(غير مؤكد)", "History data {n} " "بيانات السجل {n} ", "Home" "الرئيسية", "IPLD manifest" "بيان IPLD", "Item details" "تفاصيل العنصر", "Kind of data" "نوع البيانات", "Loading the data…" "جارٍ تحميل البيانات…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "شروط استخدام MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "لا توجد عناصر مطابقة.", "OTRF terms of use" "شروط استخدام OTRF", "Ontology" "الأنطولوجيا", "Public data" "بيانات عامة", "Public lab log" "سجل المختبر العام", "Public logs" "السجلات العامة", "Read the audit log" "قراءة سجل التدقيق", "Research with this evidence" "البحث بهذا الدليل", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "يُرسل SAST نتائج فحص الكود مع اسم الملف والسطر إلى سجل VM، مما يسرّع تحديد هدف الإصلاح.", "Scenario and assumptions" "السيناريو والافتراضات", "Scope and how the data is collected" "نطاق البيانات وطريقة جمعها", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "البحث بواسطة CVE أو معرّف ATT&CK أو الاسم", "Search the data" "البحث في البيانات", "Security public data" "بيانات الأمان العامة", "Security services" "خدمات الأمان", "Snapshot CID" "CID للقطة اللحظية", "Source and archive" "المصدر والأرشيف", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "تُفصَل الادعاءات ذات المصدر عن السجلات المرصودة وسيناريوهات التحليل. ووجود إدراج في قائمة KEV بمفرده لا يقرر أبدًا أن أصلاً معينًا معرّض للاختراق أو يُسمّي مهاجمًا.", "Sourced relations" "علاقات ذات مصدر", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "اختبار أمان التطبيقات الساكن: يحلّل الكود المصدري للبحث عن أنماط معرضة للاختراق وتنقية مفقودة، ويُبلّغ عن نتائج الكود إلى سجل VM.", "Technique" "أسلوب", "Techniques" "الأساليب", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "مُعرّفات CID الخاصة بـ IPLD هي المصدر المرجعي للحقيقة؛ ويتم توليد صيغتي JSON-LD وDatomic من البيانات نفسها. تُقدَّم الكُتل عبر HTTPS. أما التوزيع على شبكة IPFS والتسجيل تحت المرجع الواحد للموسوعة فهما خطوتان منفصلتان.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "مجموعة خدمات الأمان الأولية على kotoba.cloud. تتدفق نتائج CTEM و DAST و SAST إلى سجل VM بمخطط مشترك واحد.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "يقود سجل المصدر إلى الرابط الأصلي ووقت الجلب والنص المؤرشف.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "تُصدر الخدمات الثلاث المصدر (upstream) نتائج بمخطط مشترك؛ وتقوم خدمة VM بإزالة التكرار وتسجيل النقاط وتتبّع المعالجة.", "This hub" "هذا المحور", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "تُعرض هذه الصفحة وواجهة GET /v1/security/services من نفس التعريف المرجعي الواحد. يبقى التطبيق الفعلي (enforcement) لدى السلطة الخاصة؛ وهذا السطح يقتصر على الوصف.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "هذا السيناريو قالب تحليل، وليس رصدًا فعليًا.", "Threat model" "نموذج تهديد", "Threat models" "نماذج التهديد", "VM integration: " "تكامل VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM هي خدمة السجل: تستقبل نتائج الخدمات الثلاث المصدر بالمخطط المشترك، وتزيل التكرار وتُسجّل النقاط وتتبّع المعالجة.", "Vulnerabilities" "الثغرات", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "الثغرات والأساليب والمجموعات والسجلات — كل منها قابل للتتبع إلى مصدره.", "Vulnerability" "ثغرة", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "إدارة الثغرات (wvme): تستقبل نتائج المخطط المشترك الصادرة عن الخدمات الثلاث المصدر، وتزيل التكرار وتُسجّل النقاط بحسب قابلية الوصول وقابلية الاستغلال، وتتبّع دورة حياة المعالجة في سجل مفتاحه CPE/CVE. تقبل مُدخلات تغذية CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "سياق الأصل (المسارات العامة، التبعيات، المالك)", "code findings with file and line" "نتائج الكود (الملف والسطر)", "component shipped" "المكوّن متاح", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "الحصر المستمر لسطح الهجوم الخارجي والأصول", "dynamic probing of running applications" "الفحص الديناميكي للتطبيقات قيد التشغيل", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "أحداث التعرّض المُغذّاة إلى سجل VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "إزالة تكرار النتائج (مفتاح الأصل × الثغرة)", "gated" "مُقيَّد", "inputs: " "المُدخلات: ", "outputs: " "المخرجات: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "الفحص بسيناريوهات مُصادَقة", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "تسجيل قابلية الوصول × قابلية الاستغلال", "reachable attack-path identification" "تحديد مسارات الهجوم القابلة للوصول", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "دورة حياة المعالجة (اكتُشف ← قيد التنفيذ ← تم التحقق ← مُغلق)", "role: " "الدور: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "رصد الثغرات في وقت التشغيل كنتائج", "static source-code analysis" "تحليل ثابت لشيفرة المصدر", "taint / data-flow inspection" "فحص تدفق البيانات (taint)", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "سجل ثغرات مصنّف بمعرّفات CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} تقرير غير مؤكد سابق. ليس عدد الضحايا المؤكدين.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} عنصر · {claims} مطالبة موثّقة بمصدر · تم الجلب {date} "}, :ar-MA {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "هادي أول لقطة: آخر 50 مدخلة ديال KEV، تلات مجموعات ديال ATT&CK مع التقنيات ديالهم، وسجلات المختبر العمومي ديال OTRF. SCAP هو كاتالوگ ديال المواصفات، ماشي محرك تقييم ولا مجموعة كاملة ديال تعريفات الفحص. التحديثات الأوتوماتيكية ماشي مفعّلة.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "سجل تدقيق ديال مختبر منشور. ماشي حادثة حقيقية.", "All" "الكل", "CID of this record" "CID ديال هاد السجل", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM كيسلّم مسارات الهجوم والسياق ديال الأصول لسجل VM؛ وهاد المعطيات هي الأساس ديال نقطة الوصولية.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "استقبال فيد CVE/CPE", "Capability" "القدرة", "Catalog" "الكاتالوگ", "Chat" "الشات", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "إدارة التعرض للتهديدات المستمرة (CTEM): كتعدّد بشكل مستمر سطح الهجوم الخارجي ونقط الدخول، وكتسلّم مسارات الهجوم والسياق ديال الأصول لسجل VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "ما قدرناش نحملو المعطيات. عاود المحاولة من بعد.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST كيصدر نتائج قابلة للتكرار فوقت التشغيل (دليل ديال الطلب/الجواب) لسجل VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "تدفق المعطيات نحو سجل VM", "Datomic schema" "سكيما Datomic", "Description" "الوصف", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "اختبار أمان التطبيقات الديناميكي (DAST): كيفحص التطبيقات فحال ماشي خدامة وكيرابور النتائج ديال وقت التشغيل لسجل VM.", "Encyclopedia" "الموسوعة", "Full record" "السجل الكامل", "Group" "المجموعة", "Groups" "المجموعات", "Guide for LLMs" "دليل لـ LLMs", "History (unconfirmed)" "التاريخ (غير مؤكد)", "History data {n} " "المعطيات ديال التاريخ {n} ", "Home" "الرئيسية", "IPLD manifest" "مانيفست IPLD", "Item details" "تفاصيل العنصر", "Kind of data" "نوع المعطيات", "Loading the data…" "كتحمل المعطيات…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "شروط استخدام MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "ماكاينة حتى نتيجة موافقة.", "OTRF terms of use" "شروط استخدام OTRF", "Ontology" "الأنطولوجيا", "Public data" "معطيات عمومية", "Public lab log" "سجل المختبر العمومي", "Public logs" "السجلات العمومية", "Read the audit log" "قرا سجل التدقيق", "Research with this evidence" "بحث بهاد الدليل", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST كيصدر نتائج ديال الكود مع الملف والسطر لسجل VM، حيت هادشي كيسرّع تحديد الهدف ديال التصحيح.", "Scenario and assumptions" "السيناريو والفرضيات", "Scope and how the data is collected" "النطاق وكيفاش كيتجمعو المعطيات", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "قلب بـ CVE، رقم ATT&CK أولا الاسم", "Search the data" "قلب فالمعطيات", "Security public data" "معطيات الأمان العمومية", "Security services" "خدمات الأمان", "Snapshot CID" "Snapshot CID", "Source and archive" "المصدر والأرشيف", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "الادعاءات المصدرة (sourced)، السجلات المرصودة، و سيناريوهات التحليل كايبقاو منفصلين. تسجيل فـ KEV بوحدو ماكيقررش بلي أصل معين فيه ثغرة أولا كيسمي مهاجم.", "Sourced relations" "علاقات مصدرة", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "اختبار أمان التطبيقات الستاتيكي (SAST): كيحلل الكود المصدري باش يلقى الأنماط الهشة والتنقية الناقصة، و كيقدم findings ديال الكود لسجل VM.", "Technique" "تقنية", "Techniques" "التقنيات", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "CIDs ديال IPLD هوما المصدر الحقيقي (source of truth)؛ الصيغ ديال JSON-LD و Datomic كايتولدو من نفس المعطيات. البلوكات كايتقدمو عبر HTTPS. التوزيع لشبكة IPFS و التسجيل تحت الـ ref الواحد ديال الإنسيكلوبيديا هوما خطوات منفصلة.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "سويت ديال خدمات الأمان الأولية (first-party) فـ kotoba.cloud. findings ديال CTEM، DAST و SAST كايدخلو لسجل VM بسكيما واحدة مشتركة.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "سجل المصدر كيوديك للـ URL الأصلي، وقت الجلب، والنص المؤرشف.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "التلاتة ديال الخدمات upstream كايصدرو findings بسكيما مشتركة؛ VM كيدوبلي، كيسكور و كيتراكي remediation.", "This hub" "هاد المركز", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "هاد الصفحة و GET /v1/security/services كايتعرضو من نفس التعريف الأساسي (canonical). التطبيق (enforcement) كيبقى عند السلطة الخاصة (private authority)؛ هاد الواجهة غير كاتوصف.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "هاد السيناريو هو قالب تحليل، ماشي رصد.", "Threat model" "نموذج التهديد", "Threat models" "نماذج التهديد", "VM integration: " "التكامل مع VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM هو خدمة السجل (ledger): كايستقبل findings ديال التلاتة ديال الخدمات upstream بسكيما المشتركة و كيدوبليهم، كيسكورهم و كيتراكي remediation.", "Vulnerabilities" "الثغرات", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "الثغرات، التقنيات، المجموعات والسجلات — كلشي فيهم قابل للتتبع لمصدرو.", "Vulnerability" "ثغرة", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "تدبير الثغرات (wvme): كيستهلك findings بسكيما مشتركة اللي كايصدروهم التلاتة ديال الخدمات upstream، كيدوبليهم و كيسكورهم حسب القابلية للوصول (reachability) و القابلية للاستغلال (exploitability)، و كيتراكي دورة حياة remediation فـ سجل (ledger) مفتاحو CPE/CVE. كيقبل input ديال feed CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "سياق الأصل (المسارات العامة، التبعيات، المالك)", "code findings with file and line" "findings ديال الكود مع الملف والسطر", "component shipped" "مكون صدر", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "إحصاء متواصل لسطح الهجوم الخارجي والأصول", "dynamic probing of running applications" "فحص ديناميكي للتطبيقات الجارية", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "أحداث التعرض (exposure) اللي كاتتغذى بها سجل VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "إزالة تكرار findings (مفتاح الأصل × الثغرة)", "gated" "محدود الوصول", "inputs: " "المدخلات: ", "outputs: " "المخرجات: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "الفحص بسيناريوهات موثقة (authenticated)", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "سكورينغ ديال reachability × exploitability", "reachable attack-path identification" "تحديد المسارات القابلة للوصول للهجوم", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "دورة حياة remediation (تكتشف → قيد المعالجة → تأكدت → مسدودة)", "role: " "الدور: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "الكشف عن الثغرات فـ الوقت الحقيقي كـ نتائج", "static source-code analysis" "التحليل الثابت للكود المصدري", "taint / data-flow inspection" "فحص تدفق البيانات (taint)", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "سجل الثغرات مرتب بـ CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} تقرير سابق غير مؤكد. ماشي عدد الضحايا المؤكدين.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} عنصر · {claims} ادعاء موثق · تم الجلب {date} "}, :arz {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "لقطة أولى: أحدث 50 إدخال في KEV، تلات مجموعات ATT&CK مع تقنياتهم، وسجلات معمل OTRF العامة. SCAP هو كتالوج مواصفات، مش محرك تقييم أو مجموعة كاملة من تعريفات الفحص. التحديثات الأوتوماتيكية مش مفعّلة.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "سجل تدقيق معمل منشور. مش حادثة حقيقية.", "All" "الكل", "CID of this record" "CID الخاص بالسجل ده", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM بيسلّم مسارات الهجوم وسياق الأصول لسجل VM؛ وده يكون الأساس لدرجة إمكانية الوصول.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "استقبال تغذية CVE/CPE", "Capability" "الإمكانية", "Catalog" "الكتالوج", "Chat" "الشات", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "إدارة التعرض المستمر للتهديدات (CTEM): بتحصر بشكل مستمر سطح الهجوم الخارجي ونقط الدخول، وبتسلّم مسارات الهجوم وسياق الأصول لسجل VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "معرفناش نحمّل البيانات. حاول تاني بعدين.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST بيبعت نتائج تشغيل قابلة للتكرار (دليل الطلب/الرد) لسجل VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "تدفق البيانات لسجل VM", "Datomic schema" "سكيمة Datomic", "Description" "الوصف", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "اختبار أمان التطبيقات الديناميكي (DAST): بيفحص التطبيقات الشغالة وبيبلّغ عن نتائج التشغيل لسجل VM.", "Encyclopedia" "الموسوعة", "Full record" "السجل كامل", "Group" "المجموعة", "Groups" "المجموعات", "Guide for LLMs" "دليل لـ LLMs", "History (unconfirmed)" "السجل (غير مؤكد)", "History data {n} " "بيانات السجل {n} ", "Home" "الرئيسية", "IPLD manifest" "مانفست IPLD", "Item details" "تفاصيل العنصر", "Kind of data" "نوع البيانات", "Loading the data…" "بيحمّل البيانات…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "شروط استخدام MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "مافيش عناصر مطابقة.", "OTRF terms of use" "شروط استخدام OTRF", "Ontology" "الأنطولوجيا", "Public data" "بيانات عامة", "Public lab log" "سجل معمل عام", "Public logs" "سجلات عامة", "Read the audit log" "اقرا سجل التدقيق", "Research with this evidence" "بحث بالدليل ده", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST بيبعت نتائج الكود مع الملف والسطر لسجل VM، عشان هدف التصحيح يتلاقى أسرع.", "Scenario and assumptions" "السيناريو والافتراضات", "Scope and how the data is collected" "نطاق البيانات وطريقة تجميعها", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "ابحث بـ CVE أو ATT&CK ID أو الاسم", "Search the data" "ابحث في البيانات", "Security public data" "بيانات الأمان العامة", "Security services" "خدمات الأمان", "Snapshot CID" "CID اللقطة (Snapshot)", "Source and archive" "المصدر والأرشيف", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "الادعاءات ذات المصدر، والسجلات المرصودة، وسيناريوهات التحليل بيتم الفصل بينهم. مجرد وجود عنصر في قايمة KEV مش بيقرر إن أصل معيّن فيه ثغرة أو يحدد اسم المهاجم.", "Sourced relations" "علاقات موثّقة المصدر", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "اختبار أمان التطبيقات الساكن (SAST): بيحلل الكود المصدري عشان يلاقي أنماط فيها ثغرات وتنقية بيانات ناقصة، وبيبلغ نتايج الكود لسجل VM.", "Technique" "التقنية", "Techniques" "التقنيات", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "الـ CIDs بتاعة IPLD هي المصدر الحقيقي؛ صيغ JSON-LD و Datomic بتتولد من نفس البيانات. والبلوكات بتتقدم عن طريق HTTPS. التوزيع على شبكة IPFS والتسجيل تحت الـ ref الواحد بتاع الموسوعة دول خطوات منفصلة.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "مجموعة خدمات الأمان الأساسية (first-party) على kotoba.cloud. نتايج CTEM و DAST و SAST بتتجمع في سجل VM بسكيمة مشتركة واحدة.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "سجل المصدر بيودّي للرابط الأصلي، ووقت الجلب، والنص المؤرشف.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "التلات خدمات upstream بتبعت نتايج (findings) بسكيمة مشتركة؛ وخدمة VM بتشيل التكرار، بتقيّم، وبتتابع الحل.", "This hub" "المحور ده", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "الصفحة دي و GET /v1/security/services بيترسموا من نفس التعريف الأساسي (canonical). التنفيذ (enforcement) فاضل مع الـ authority الخاص؛ الواجهة دي بس بتوصف.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "السيناريو ده قالب تحليل، مش رصد فعلي.", "Threat model" "نموذج التهديد", "Threat models" "نماذج التهديد", "VM integration: " "تكامل VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM هي خدمة السجل (ledger): بتستقبل نتايج التلات خدمات upstream بالسكيمة المشتركة، وبتشيل التكرار وبتقيّم وبتتابع الحل.", "Vulnerabilities" "الثغرات", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "الثغرات، والتقنيات، والمجموعات، والسجلات — كل واحد منهم يمكن تتبعه لمصدره.", "Vulnerability" "الثغرة", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "إدارة الثغرات (wvme): بتستقبل نتايج السكيمة المشتركة اللي بتبعتها التلات خدمات upstream، بتشيل التكرار منها وبتقيّمها على حسب إمكانية الوصول والاستغلال، وبتتابع دورة حياة الحل في سجل (ledger) متربط بـ CPE/CVE. وبتقبل مدخلات feed من نوع CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "سياق الأصل (المسارات العامة، الاعتماديات، المالك)", "code findings with file and line" "نتايج الكود (code findings) مع الملف والسطر", "component shipped" "المكوّن متاح دلوقتي", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "حصر مستمر لسطح الهجوم الخارجي والأصول", "dynamic probing of running applications" "فحص ديناميكي للتطبيقات الشغالة", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "أحداث التعرض (exposure) بتتغذى لسجل VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "إزالة تكرار النتايج (مفتاح الأصل × الثغرة)", "gated" "مقفول", "inputs: " "المدخلات: ", "outputs: " "المخرجات: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "الفحص بسيناريوهات موثّقة الدخول (authenticated)", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "تقييم إمكانية الوصول × إمكانية الاستغلال", "reachable attack-path identification" "تحديد مسارات الهجوم القابلة للوصول", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "دورة حياة الحل (تم الرصد ← جاري العمل ← تم التحقق ← مقفول)", "role: " "الدور: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "كشف الثغرات وقت التشغيل كنتائج", "static source-code analysis" "تحليل الكود المصدري الساكن", "taint / data-flow inspection" "فحص تدفق البيانات / التلوث (taint)", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "سجل الثغرات المفتّح بـ CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} تقرير سابق غير مؤكد. مش عدد الضحايا المؤكدين.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} عنصر · {claims} ادعاء موثّق · تم الجلب في {date} "}, :bn {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "একটি প্রাথমিক স্ন্যাপশট: সাম্প্রতিকতম ৫০টি KEV এন্ট্রি, তাদের কৌশলসহ তিনটি ATT&CK গ্রুপ, এবং OTRF-এর পাবলিক ল্যাব লগ। SCAP একটি স্পেসিফিকেশন ক্যাটালগ, কোনো মূল্যায়ন ইঞ্জিন বা সম্পূর্ণ চেক ডেফিনিশন সেট নয়। অটোমেটিক আপডেট কনফিগার করা নেই।", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "একটি প্রকাশিত ল্যাব অডিট লগ। এটি বাস্তব কোনো ঘটনা নয়।", "All" "সব", "CID of this record" "এই রেকর্ডের CID", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM অ্যাটাক পাথ এবং অ্যাসেট কনটেক্সট VM লেজারে সরবরাহ করে; এগুলোই রিচেবিলিটি স্কোরের ভিত্তি।", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "CVE/CPE ফিড ইনটেক", "Capability" "সক্ষমতা", "Catalog" "ক্যাটালগ", "Chat" "চ্যাট", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "কনটিনিউয়াস থ্রেট এক্সপোজার ম্যানেজমেন্ট: বহিরাগত অ্যাটাক সারফেস এবং এন্ট্রি পয়েন্ট নিরন্তর তালিকাভুক্ত করে, এবং অ্যাটাক পাথ ও অ্যাসেট কনটেক্সট VM লেজারে সরবরাহ করে।", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "ডেটা লোড করা যায়নি। পরে আবার চেষ্টা করুন।", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST পুনরুৎপাদনযোগ্য রানটাইম ফাইন্ডিং (রিকোয়েস্ট/রেসপন্স প্রমাণ) VM লেজারে পাঠায়।", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "VM লেজারে ডেটাফ্লো", "Datomic schema" "Datomic স্কিমা", "Description" "বর্ণনা", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "ডায়নামিক অ্যাপ্লিকেশন সিকিউরিটি টেস্টিং: চলমান অ্যাপ্লিকেশন পরীক্ষা করে এবং রানটাইম ফাইন্ডিং VM লেজারে রিপোর্ট করে।", "Encyclopedia" "এনসাইক্লোপিডিয়া", "Full record" "সম্পূর্ণ রেকর্ড", "Group" "গ্রুপ", "Groups" "গ্রুপ", "Guide for LLMs" "LLM-দের জন্য নির্দেশিকা", "History (unconfirmed)" "ইতিহাস (অনিশ্চিত)", "History data {n} " "ইতিহাস ডেটা {n} ", "Home" "হোম", "IPLD manifest" "IPLD ম্যানিফেস্ট", "Item details" "আইটেমের বিস্তারিত", "Kind of data" "ডেটার ধরন", "Loading the data…" "ডেটা লোড হচ্ছে…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "MITRE ATT&CK ব্যবহারের শর্তাবলী", "No matching items." "মিলে যায় এমন কোনো আইটেম নেই।", "OTRF terms of use" "OTRF ব্যবহারের শর্তাবলী", "Ontology" "অন্টোলজি", "Public data" "পাবলিক ডেটা", "Public lab log" "পাবলিক ল্যাব লগ", "Public logs" "পাবলিক লগ", "Read the audit log" "অডিট লগ পড়ুন", "Research with this evidence" "এই প্রমাণ দিয়ে গবেষণা করুন", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST ফাইল ও লাইনসহ কোড ফাইন্ডিং VM লেজারে পাঠায়, যাতে সংশোধনের লক্ষ্য দ্রুত খুঁজে পাওয়া যায়।", "Scenario and assumptions" "স্ক্রিন সিনারিও এবং অনুমান", "Scope and how the data is collected" "স্কোপ এবং ডেটা সংগ্রহের পদ্ধতি", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "CVE, ATT&CK আইডি বা নাম দিয়ে সার্চ করুন", "Search the data" "ডেটা সার্চ করুন", "Security public data" "সিকিউরিটি পাবলিক ডেটা", "Security services" "সিকিউরিটি সার্ভিসসমূহ", "Snapshot CID" "স্ন্যাপশট CID", "Source and archive" "সোর্স এবং আর্কাইভ", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "সোর্সযুক্ত দাবি, পর্যবেক্ষিত লগ এবং বিশ্লেষণ সিনারিও আলাদা রাখা হয়। কেবল একটি KEV লিস্টিং কখনো নির্ধারণ করে না যে কোনো নির্দিষ্ট অ্যাসেট ভালনারেবল, বা কোনো আক্রমণকারীর নাম দেয় না।", "Sourced relations" "সোর্সযুক্ত সম্পর্ক", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "স্ট্যাটিক অ্যাপ্লিকেশন সিকিউরিটি টেস্টিং: সোর্স কোড বিশ্লেষণ করে ভালনারেবল প্যাটার্ন এবং অনুপস্থিত স্যানিটাইজেশন খুঁজে বের করে, এবং কোড ফাইন্ডিংস VM লেজারে রিপোর্ট করে।", "Technique" "টেকনিক", "Techniques" "টেকনিকসমূহ", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "IPLD CID-গুলো সোর্স অফ ট্রুথ; JSON-LD এবং Datomic ফর্ম একই ডেটা থেকে তৈরি করা হয়। ব্লকগুলো HTTPS-এর মাধ্যমে সার্ভ করা হয়। IPFS নেটওয়ার্কে ডিস্ট্রিবিউশন এবং এনসাইক্লোপিডিয়ার একক ref-এর অধীনে রেজিস্ট্রেশন আলাদা ধাপ।", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "kotoba.cloud-এর ফার্স্ট-পার্টি সিকিউরিটি সার্ভিস স্যুট। CTEM, DAST এবং SAST ফাইন্ডিংস একটি শেয়ার্ড স্কিমায় VM লেজারে প্রবেশ করে।", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "সোর্স রেকর্ড থেকে মূল URL, ফেচ করার সময় এবং আর্কাইভ করা টেক্সট পাওয়া যায়।", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "উর্ধ্বতন তিনটি সার্ভিস একটি শেয়ার্ড স্কিমায় ফাইন্ডিংস প্রকাশ করে; VM সেগুলোর ডিডুপ, স্কোরিং এবং প্রতিকার ট্র্যাকিং করে।", "This hub" "এই হাব", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "এই পেজ এবং GET /v1/security/services একই ক্যানোনিকাল সংজ্ঞা থেকে রেন্ডার হয়। এনফোর্সমেন্ট প্রাইভেট অথরিটির কাছেই থাকে; এই সারফেস শুধু বর্ণনা করে।", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "এই সিনারিও একটি বিশ্লেষণ টেমপ্লেট, কোনো পর্যবেক্ষণ নয়।", "Threat model" "থ্রেট মডেল", "Threat models" "থ্রেট মডেলসমূহ", "VM integration: " "VM ইন্টিগ্রেশন: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM হলো লেজার সার্ভিস: এটি উর্ধ্বতন তিনটি সার্ভিসের ফাইন্ডিংস শেয়ার্ড স্কিমায় গ্রহণ করে এবং ডিডুপ, স্কোরিং ও প্রতিকার ট্র্যাক করে।", "Vulnerabilities" "ভালনারেবিলিটিসমূহ", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "ভালনারেবিলিটি, টেকনিক, গ্রুপ এবং লগ — প্রতিটি নিজ নিজ সোর্স পর্যন্ত ট্রেসযোগ্য।", "Vulnerability" "ভালনারেবিলিটি", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "ভালনারেবিলিটি ম্যানেজমেন্ট (wvme): উর্ধ্বতন তিনটি সার্ভিসের প্রকাশিত শেয়ার্ড-স্কিমা ফাইন্ডিংস গ্রহণ করে, রিচেবিলিটি ও এক্সপ্লয়টেবিলিটি অনুসারে সেগুলোর ডিডুপ ও স্কোরিং করে, এবং CPE/CVE কী-যুক্ত একটি লেজারে প্রতিকার লাইফসাইকেল ট্র্যাক করে। CVE/CPE ফিড ইনপুট গ্রহণ করে।", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "অ্যাসেট কনটেক্সট (পাবলিক রুট, ডিপেন্ডেন্সি, মালিক)", "code findings with file and line" "ফাইল ও লাইন সহ কোড ফাইন্ডিংস", "component shipped" "কম্পোনেন্ট শিপ করা হয়েছে", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "নিরবচ্ছিন্ন বাহ্যিক অ্যাটাক-সারফেস এবং অ্যাসেট ইনভেন্টরি", "dynamic probing of running applications" "চলমান অ্যাপ্লিকেশনগুলোর ডাইনামিক প্রোবিং", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "VM লেজারে ফিড করা এক্সপোজার ইভেন্ট", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "ফাইন্ডিং ডিডুপ্লিকেশন (অ্যাসেট × ভালনারেবিলিটি কী)", "gated" "গেটেড", "inputs: " "ইনপুট: ", "outputs: " "আউটপুট: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "অথেন্টিকেটেড সিনারিও দিয়ে প্রোবিং", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "রিচেবিলিটি × এক্সপ্লয়টেবিলিটি স্কোরিং", "reachable attack-path identification" "পৌঁছানো-যোগ্য অ্যাটাক-পাথ চিহ্নিতকরণ", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "প্রতিকার লাইফসাইকেল (সনাক্ত হয়েছে → চলমান → যাচাই হয়েছে → বন্ধ)", "role: " "ভূমিকা: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "রানটাইম দুর্বলতা সনাক্তকরণ ফাইন্ডিংস হিসেবে", "static source-code analysis" "স্ট্যাটিক সোর্স-কোড বিশ্লেষণ", "taint / data-flow inspection" "টেইন্ট / ডেটা-ফ্লো পরিদর্শন", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "CPE/CVE দ্বারা কী করা দুর্বলতা লেজার", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count}টি অতীত অনিশ্চিত প্রতিবেদন। নিশ্চিত ভুক্তভোগীর সংখ্যা নয়।", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items}টি আইটেম · {claims}টি উৎসযুক্ত দাবি · আনা হয়েছে {date} "}, :de {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Ein erster Snapshot: die 50 aktuellsten KEV-Einträge, drei ATT&CK-Gruppen mit ihren Techniken sowie die öffentlichen Lab-Logs von OTRF. SCAP ist ein Katalog von Spezifikationen, keine Evaluierungs-Engine und kein vollständiger Satz von Prüfdefinitionen. Automatische Updates sind nicht konfiguriert.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Ein veröffentlichtes Lab-Audit-Log. Kein realer Vorfall.", "All" "Alle", "CID of this record" "CID dieses Datensatzes", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM übergibt Angriffspfade und Asset-Kontext an das VM-Ledger; sie bilden die Grundlage für den Reachability-Score.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "CVE/CPE-Feed-Erfassung", "Capability" "Funktion", "Catalog" "Katalog", "Chat" "Chat", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: erfasst kontinuierlich die externe Angriffsfläche und Einstiegspunkte und übergibt Angriffspfade sowie Asset-Kontext an das VM-Ledger.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "Die Daten konnten nicht geladen werden. Bitte später erneut versuchen.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST liefert reproduzierbare Laufzeitbefunde (Request-/Response-Belege) an das VM-Ledger.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Datenfluss in das VM-Ledger", "Datomic schema" "Datomic-Schema", "Description" "Beschreibung", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Dynamic Application Security Testing: prüft laufende Anwendungen und meldet Laufzeitbefunde an das VM-Ledger.", "Encyclopedia" "Enzyklopädie", "Full record" "Vollständiger Datensatz", "Group" "Gruppe", "Groups" "Gruppen", "Guide for LLMs" "Leitfaden für LLMs", "History (unconfirmed)" "Verlauf (unbestätigt)", "History data {n} " "Verlaufsdaten {n} ", "Home" "Startseite", "IPLD manifest" "IPLD-Manifest", "Item details" "Details zum Eintrag", "Kind of data" "Datentyp", "Loading the data…" "Daten werden geladen…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "MITRE ATT&CK-Nutzungsbedingungen", "No matching items." "Keine passenden Einträge.", "OTRF terms of use" "OTRF-Nutzungsbedingungen", "Ontology" "Ontologie", "Public data" "Öffentliche Daten", "Public lab log" "Öffentliches Lab-Log", "Public logs" "Öffentliche Logs", "Read the audit log" "Audit-Log lesen", "Research with this evidence" "Mit diesem Beleg recherchieren", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST liefert Code-Befunde mit Datei und Zeile an das VM-Ledger, sodass das Fix-Ziel schneller gefunden wird.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Szenario und Annahmen", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Umfang und Erhebung der Daten", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Suche nach CVE, ATT&CK-ID oder Name", "Search the data" "Daten durchsuchen", "Security public data" "Öffentliche Security-Daten", "Security services" "Security-Services", "Snapshot CID" "Snapshot-CID", "Source and archive" "Quelle und Archiv", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Belegte Aussagen, beobachtete Protokolle und Analyse-Szenarien werden getrennt gehalten. Ein KEV-Einträg allein entscheidet niemals, dass ein bestimmtes Asset verwundbar ist oder benennt einen Angreifer.", "Sourced relations" "Belegte Beziehungen", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Statische Anwendungssicherheitsprüfung: analysiert Quellcode auf anfällige Muster und fehlende Bereinigung und meldet Code-Befunde an das VM-Register.", "Technique" "Angriffstechnik", "Techniques" "Angriffstechniken", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "Die IPLD-CIDs sind die maßgebliche Quelle; die JSON-LD- und Datomic-Formen werden aus denselben Daten erzeugt. Die Blöcke werden über HTTPS bereitgestellt. Die Verteilung an das IPFS-Netzwerk und die Registrierung unter dem einheitlichen Ref der Enzyklopädie sind separate Schritte.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "Die eigene Security-Services-Suite auf kotoba.cloud. CTEM-, DAST- und SAST-Befunde fließen in einem gemeinsamen Schema in das VM-Register.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "Der Quelldatensatz führt zur ursprünglichen URL, zum Abrufzeitpunkt und zum archivierten Text.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "Die drei vorgeschalteten Dienste liefern Befunde in einem gemeinsamen Schema; VM dedupliziert, bewertet und verfolgt die Behebung.", "This hub" "Dieser Hub", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Diese Seite und GET /v1/security/services werden aus derselben kanonischen Definition erzeugt. Die Durchsetzung bleibt bei der privaten Autorität; diese Oberfläche beschreibt nur.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Dieses Szenario ist eine Analysevorlage, keine Beobachtung.", "Threat model" "Bedrohungsmodell", "Threat models" "Bedrohungsmodelle", "VM integration: " "VM-Integration: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM ist der Register-Dienst: Er empfängt die Befunde der drei vorgeschalteten Dienste im gemeinsamen Schema und dedupliziert, bewertet und verfolgt die Behebung.", "Vulnerabilities" "Schwachstellen", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Schwachstellen, Techniken, Gruppen und Protokolle — jeweils bis zur Quelle nachverfolgbar.", "Vulnerability" "Schwachstelle", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Schwachstellenmanagement (wvme): verarbeitet die von den drei vorgeschalteten Diensten gelieferten Befunde im gemeinsamen Schema, dedupliziert und bewertet sie nach Erreichbarkeit und Ausnutzbarkeit und verfolgt den Behebungs-Lebenszyklus in einem nach CPE/CVE geführten Register. Akzeptiert CVE/CPE-Feed-Eingaben.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "Asset-Kontext (öffentliche Routen, Abhängigkeiten, Eigentümer)", "code findings with file and line" "Code-Befunde mit Datei und Zeile", "component shipped" "Komponente ausgeliefert", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "fortlaufende Erfassung externer Angriffsfläche und Asset-Inventar", "dynamic probing of running applications" "dynamische Prüfung laufender Anwendungen", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "Exposure-Ereignisse, die an das VM-Register gemeldet werden", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "Deduplizierung der Befunde (Schlüssel Asset × Schwachstelle)", "gated" "gesperrt", "inputs: " "Eingaben: ", "outputs: " "Ausgaben: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "Prüfung mit authentifizierten Szenarien", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "Bewertung nach Erreichbarkeit × Ausnutzbarkeit", "reachable attack-path identification" "Erkennung erreichbarer Angriffspfade", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "Behebungs-Lebenszyklus (erkannt → in Bearbeitung → verifiziert → geschlossen)", "role: " "Rolle: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "Laufzeit-Schwachstellenerkennung als Befunde", "static source-code analysis" "Statische Quellcode-Analyse", "taint / data-flow inspection" "Taint-/Datenfluss-Prüfung", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "Schwachstellen-Register nach CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} bisherige unbestätigte Meldungen. Keine Zählung bestätigter Betroffener.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} Elemente · {claims} belegte Aussagen · abgerufen {date} "}, :es {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Una primera instantánea: las 50 entradas más recientes de KEV, tres grupos de ATT&CK con sus técnicas, y los registros de laboratorio públicos de OTRF. SCAP es un catálogo de especificaciones, no un motor de evaluación ni el conjunto completo de definiciones de comprobación. Las actualizaciones automáticas no están configuradas.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Un registro de auditoría de laboratorio publicado. No es un incidente real.", "All" "Todos", "CID of this record" "CID de este registro", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM entrega rutas de ataque y contexto de activos al libro mayor de VM; son la base de la puntuación de accesibilidad.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "Ingesta de feeds CVE/CPE", "Capability" "Capacidad", "Catalog" "Catálogo", "Chat" "Chat", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Gestión continua de la exposición a amenazas: enumera continuamente la superficie de ataque externa y los puntos de entrada, y entrega rutas de ataque más contexto de activos al libro mayor de VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "No se pudieron cargar los datos. Inténtalo de nuevo más tarde.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST envía hallazgos reproducibles en tiempo de ejecución (evidencia de solicitud/respuesta) al libro mayor de VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Flujo de datos hacia el libro mayor de VM", "Datomic schema" "Esquema Datomic", "Description" "Descripción", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Pruebas dinámicas de seguridad de aplicaciones: examina aplicaciones en ejecución e informa hallazgos en tiempo de ejecución al libro mayor de VM.", "Encyclopedia" "Enciclopedia", "Full record" "Registro completo", "Group" "Grupo", "Groups" "Grupos", "Guide for LLMs" "Guía para LLM", "History (unconfirmed)" "Historial (sin confirmar)", "History data {n} " "Datos históricos {n} ", "Home" "Inicio", "IPLD manifest" "Manifiesto IPLD", "Item details" "Detalles del elemento", "Kind of data" "Tipo de datos", "Loading the data…" "Cargando los datos…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "Condiciones de uso de MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "No hay elementos coincidentes.", "OTRF terms of use" "Condiciones de uso de OTRF", "Ontology" "Ontología", "Public data" "Datos públicos", "Public lab log" "Registro de laboratorio público", "Public logs" "Registros públicos", "Read the audit log" "Leer el registro de auditoría", "Research with this evidence" "Investigar con esta evidencia", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST envía hallazgos de código con archivo y línea al libro mayor de VM, lo que agiliza la localización del objetivo de corrección.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Escenario e hipótesis", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Alcance y forma de recopilación de los datos", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Buscar por CVE, id de ATT&CK o nombre", "Search the data" "Buscar en los datos", "Security public data" "Datos públicos de seguridad", "Security services" "Servicios de seguridad", "Snapshot CID" "CID de instantánea", "Source and archive" "Origen y archivo", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Las afirmaciones con fuente, los registros observados y los escenarios de análisis se mantienen separados. La sola presencia en un listado KEV nunca determina que un activo concreto sea vulnerable ni identifica a un atacante.", "Sourced relations" "Relaciones con fuente", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Pruebas estáticas de seguridad de aplicaciones: analiza el código fuente en busca de patrones vulnerables y falta de sanitización, reportando hallazgos de código al libro registro de VM.", "Technique" "Técnica", "Techniques" "Técnicas", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "Los CID de IPLD son la fuente de verdad; las formas JSON-LD y Datomic se generan a partir de los mismos datos. Los bloques se sirven mediante HTTPS. La distribución a la red IPFS y el registro bajo la ref única de la enciclopedia son pasos separados.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "El conjunto de servicios de seguridad de primera parte en kotoba.cloud. Los hallazgos de CTEM, DAST y SAST fluyen al libro registro de VM en un único esquema compartido.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "El registro de origen lleva a la URL original, la hora de obtención y el texto archivado.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "Los tres servicios ascendentes emiten hallazgos con un esquema compartido; VM los deduplica, puntúa y hace seguimiento de la remediación.", "This hub" "Este hub", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Esta página y GET /v1/security/services se generan a partir de una única definición canónica. La aplicación de las políticas permanece en la autoridad privada; esta superficie solo describe.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Este escenario es una plantilla de análisis, no una observación.", "Threat model" "Modelo de amenaza", "Threat models" "Modelos de amenaza", "VM integration: " "Integración con VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM es el servicio de libro registro: recibe los hallazgos de los tres servicios ascendentes en el esquema compartido, los deduplica, puntúa y hace seguimiento de la remediación.", "Vulnerabilities" "Vulnerabilidades", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Vulnerabilidades, técnicas, grupos y registros — cada uno rastreable hasta su origen.", "Vulnerability" "Vulnerabilidad", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Gestión de vulnerabilidades (wvme): consume los hallazgos con esquema compartido emitidos por los tres servicios ascendentes, los deduplica y puntúa según alcanzabilidad y explotabilidad, y hace seguimiento del ciclo de vida de la remediación en un libro registro indexado por CPE/CVE. Acepta entrada de fuentes CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "contexto de activos (rutas públicas, dependencias, propietario)", "code findings with file and line" "hallazgos de código con archivo y línea", "component shipped" "componente disponible", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "inventario continuo de superficie de ataque externa y activos", "dynamic probing of running applications" "sondeo dinámico de aplicaciones en ejecución", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "eventos de exposición enviados al libro registro de VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "deduplicación de hallazgos (clave activo × vulnerabilidad)", "gated" "restringido", "inputs: " "entradas: ", "outputs: " "salidas: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "sondeo con escenarios autenticados", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "puntuación de alcanzabilidad × explotabilidad", "reachable attack-path identification" "identificación de rutas de ataque alcanzables", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "ciclo de vida de la remediación (detectado → en curso → verificado → cerrado)", "role: " "rol: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "detección de vulnerabilidades en tiempo de ejecución como hallazgos", "static source-code analysis" "análisis estático de código fuente", "taint / data-flow inspection" "inspección de taint / flujo de datos", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "registro de vulnerabilidades indexado por CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} informes anteriores sin confirmar. No es un recuento de víctimas confirmadas.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} elementos · {claims} afirmaciones con fuente · obtenido {date} "}, :fr {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Un premier instantané : les 50 entrées KEV les plus récentes, trois groupes ATT&CK avec leurs techniques, et les journaux de laboratoire publics d'OTRF. SCAP est un catalogue de spécifications, pas un moteur d'évaluation ni l'ensemble complet des définitions de contrôle. Les mises à jour automatiques ne sont pas configurées.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Un journal d'audit de laboratoire publié. Il ne s'agit pas d'un incident réel.", "All" "Tous", "CID of this record" "CID de cet enregistrement", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM transmet les chemins d'attaque et le contexte des actifs au registre VM ; ils constituent la base du score d'accessibilité.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "Ingestion du flux CVE/CPE", "Capability" "Fonctionnalité", "Catalog" "Catalogue", "Chat" "Chat", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Gestion continue de l'exposition aux menaces : recense en continu la surface d'attaque externe et les points d'entrée, et transmet les chemins d'attaque ainsi que le contexte des actifs au registre VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "Impossible de charger les données. Réessayez plus tard.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST envoie des résultats d'exécution reproductibles (preuves requête/réponse) au registre VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Flux de données vers le registre VM", "Datomic schema" "Schéma Datomic", "Description" "Description", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Test de sécurité dynamique des applications : sonde les applications en cours d'exécution et signale les résultats d'exécution au registre VM.", "Encyclopedia" "Encyclopédie", "Full record" "Enregistrement complet", "Group" "Groupe", "Groups" "Groupes", "Guide for LLMs" "Guide pour les LLM", "History (unconfirmed)" "Historique (non confirmé)", "History data {n} " "Données de l'historique {n} ", "Home" "Accueil", "IPLD manifest" "Manifeste IPLD", "Item details" "Détails de l'élément", "Kind of data" "Type de données", "Loading the data…" "Chargement des données…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "Conditions d'utilisation de MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "Aucun élément correspondant.", "OTRF terms of use" "Conditions d'utilisation d'OTRF", "Ontology" "Ontologie", "Public data" "Données publiques", "Public lab log" "Journal de laboratoire public", "Public logs" "Journaux publics", "Read the audit log" "Lire le journal d'audit", "Research with this evidence" "Rechercher avec cette preuve", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST envoie des résultats de code avec fichier et ligne au registre VM, ce qui accélère l'identification de la cible à corriger.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Scénario et hypothèses", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Périmètre et méthode de collecte des données", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Rechercher par CVE, identifiant ATT&CK ou nom", "Search the data" "Rechercher dans les données", "Security public data" "Données publiques de sécurité", "Security services" "Services de sécurité", "Snapshot CID" "CID de l'instantané", "Source and archive" "Source et archive", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Les affirmations sourcées, les journaux observés et les scénarios d'analyse sont maintenus séparés. Une inscription au KEV seule ne détermine jamais qu'un actif particulier est vulnérable ni ne nomme un attaquant.", "Sourced relations" "Relations sourcées", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Test de sécurité statique des applications : analyse le code source à la recherche de motifs vulnérables et d'absence d'assainissement, et transmet les constats de code au registre VM.", "Technique" "Technique", "Techniques" "Techniques", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "Les CID IPLD constituent la source de vérité ; les formes JSON-LD et Datomic sont générées à partir des mêmes données. Les blocs sont servis via HTTPS. La distribution vers le réseau IPFS et l'enregistrement sous la référence unique de l'encyclopédie sont des étapes distinctes.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "La suite de services de sécurité propriétaire sur kotoba.cloud. Les constats CTEM, DAST et SAST convergent vers le registre VM selon un schéma partagé unique.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "L'enregistrement source mène à l'URL d'origine, à l'heure de récupération et au texte archivé.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "Les trois services amont émettent des constats au schéma partagé ; VM les dédoublonne, les note et suit leur remédiation.", "This hub" "Ce hub", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Cette page et GET /v1/security/services sont générées à partir de la même définition canonique. L'application des règles reste du ressort de l'autorité privée ; cette surface se contente de décrire.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Ce scénario est un modèle d'analyse, pas une observation.", "Threat model" "Modèle de menace", "Threat models" "Modèles de menace", "VM integration: " "Intégration VM : ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM est le service de registre : il reçoit les constats des trois services amont selon le schéma partagé, les dédoublonne, les note et suit leur remédiation.", "Vulnerabilities" "Vulnérabilités", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Vulnérabilités, techniques, groupes et journaux — chacun traçable jusqu'à sa source.", "Vulnerability" "Vulnérabilité", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Gestion des vulnérabilités (wvme) : consomme les constats au schéma partagé émis par les trois services amont, les dédoublonne et les note selon l'accessibilité et l'exploitabilité, et suit le cycle de vie de la remédiation dans un registre indexé par CPE/CVE. Accepte un flux d'entrée CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "contexte de l'actif (routes publiques, dépendances, propriétaire)", "code findings with file and line" "détection de constats de code avec fichier et ligne", "component shipped" "composant en production", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "inventaire continu de la surface d'attaque externe et des actifs", "dynamic probing of running applications" "sondage dynamique des applications en cours d'exécution", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "envoi des événements d'exposition au registre VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "dédoublonnage des constats (clé actif × vulnérabilité)", "gated" "sous contrôle d'accès", "inputs: " "entrées : ", "outputs: " "sorties : ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "sondage avec scénarios authentifiés", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "notation accessibilité × exploitabilité", "reachable attack-path identification" "identification des chemins d'attaque accessibles", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "cycle de vie de la remédiation (détecté → en cours → vérifié → clos)", "role: " "rôle : ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "détection des vulnérabilités à l'exécution sous forme de constats", "static source-code analysis" "analyse statique du code source", "taint / data-flow inspection" "inspection taint / flux de données", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "registre des vulnérabilités indexé par CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} signalements non confirmés à ce jour. Ne correspond pas au nombre de victimes confirmées.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} éléments · {claims} affirmations sourcées · récupéré le {date} "}, :he {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "תמונת מצב ראשונית: 50 הרשומות האחרונות של KEV, שלוש קבוצות ATT&CK עם הטכניקות שלהן, ויומני המעבדה הפומביים של OTRF. SCAP הוא קטלוג מפרטים, לא מנוע הערכה או מערך מלא של הגדרות בדיקה. עדכונים אוטומטיים אינם מוגדרים.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "יומן ביקורת מעבדה שפורסם. אינו אירוע אמיתי.", "All" "הכול", "CID of this record" "CID של רשומה זו", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM מעביר נתיבי תקיפה והקשר נכסים לפנקס ה-VM; הם הבסיס לניקוד יכולת ההגעה (reachability).", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "קליטת פיד CVE/CPE", "Capability" "יכולת", "Catalog" "קטלוג", "Chat" "צ'אט", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "ניהול חשיפה מתמשך לאיומים (CTEM): מאתר באופן רציף את משטח התקיפה החיצוני ונקודות הכניסה, ומעביר נתיבי תקיפה והקשר נכסים לפנקס ה-VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "לא ניתן היה לטעון את הנתונים. נסה שוב מאוחר יותר.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST מפיק ממצאי ריצה הניתנים לשכפול (ראיות בקשה/תגובה) לפנקס ה-VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "זרימת נתונים אל פנקס ה-VM", "Datomic schema" "סכימת Datomic", "Description" "תיאור", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "בדיקת אבטחת יישומים דינמית (DAST): בוחנת יישומים פעילים ומדווחת ממצאי ריצה לפנקס ה-VM.", "Encyclopedia" "אנציקלופדיה", "Full record" "רשומה מלאה", "Group" "קבוצה", "Groups" "קבוצות", "Guide for LLMs" "מדריך עבור LLM", "History (unconfirmed)" "היסטוריה (לא מאושרת)", "History data {n} " "היסטוריית נתונים {n} ", "Home" "בית", "IPLD manifest" "מניפסט IPLD", "Item details" "פרטי הפריט", "Kind of data" "סוג הנתונים", "Loading the data…" "טוען את הנתונים…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "תנאי השימוש של MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "אין פריטים תואמים.", "OTRF terms of use" "תנאי השימוש של OTRF", "Ontology" "אונטולוגיה", "Public data" "נתונים פומביים", "Public lab log" "יומן מעבדה פומבי", "Public logs" "יומנים פומביים", "Read the audit log" "קרא את יומן הביקורת", "Research with this evidence" "חקור לפי ראיה זו", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST מפיק ממצאי קוד עם קובץ ושורה לפנקס ה-VM, כך שאיתור מטרת התיקון מהיר יותר.", "Scenario and assumptions" "תרחיש והנחות", "Scope and how the data is collected" "היקף ואופן איסוף הנתונים", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "חיפוש לפי CVE, מזהה ATT&CK או שם", "Search the data" "חיפוש בנתונים", "Security public data" "נתוני אבטחה ציבוריים", "Security services" "שירותי אבטחה", "Snapshot CID" "CID של תמונת מצב", "Source and archive" "מקור וארכיון", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "טענות מבוססות מקור, יומני רישום שנצפו ותרחישי ניתוח נשמרים בנפרד. רישום ב-KEV בלבד אינו קובע אי פעם שנכס מסוים פגיע או מזהה תוקף.", "Sourced relations" "יחסים מבוססי מקור", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "בדיקת אבטחת אפליקציות סטטית: מנתחת קוד מקור לאיתור תבניות פגיעות וחסרים בסניטיזציה, ומדווחת ממצאי קוד לפנקס VM.", "Technique" "טכניקה", "Techniques" "טכניקות", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "מזהי ה-CID של IPLD הם מקור האמת; הצורות JSON-LD ו-Datomic נוצרות מאותם הנתונים. הבלוקים מוגשים באמצעות HTTPS. הפצה לרשת IPFS ורישום תחת ה-ref היחיד של האנציקלופדיה הם שלבים נפרדים.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "חבילת שירותי האבטחה הראשוניים ב-kotoba.cloud. ממצאי CTEM, DAST ו-SAST זורמים לפנקס VM בסכימה משותפת אחת.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "רשומת המקור מובילה לכתובת ה-URL המקורית, לזמן האיסוף ולטקסט המאורכב.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "שלושת שירותי המקור שולחים ממצאים בסכימה משותפת; VM מבצע דה-דופליקציה, ניקוד ומעקב תיקון.", "This hub" "מרכז זה", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "עמוד זה ו-GET /v1/security/services נבנים מהגדרה קנונית אחת ויחידה. האכיפה נשארת בסמכות הפרטית; ממשק זה רק מתאר.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "תרחיש זה הוא תבנית ניתוח, לא תצפית.", "Threat model" "מודל איום", "Threat models" "מודלי איום", "VM integration: " "שילוב VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM הוא שירות הפנקס: הוא מקבל את ממצאי שלושת שירותי המקור בסכימה המשותפת, ומבצע דה-דופליקציה, ניקוד ומעקב תיקון.", "Vulnerabilities" "פגיעויות", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "פגיעויות, טכניקות, קבוצות ויומני רישום — כל אחד ניתן לאיתור למקורו.", "Vulnerability" "פגיעות", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "ניהול פגיעויות (wvme): צורך את הממצאים בסכימה המשותפת שנשלחים משלושת שירותי המקור, מבצע דה-דופליקציה וניקוד לפי נגישות (reachability) וניתנות לניצול (exploitability), ועוקב אחר מחזור חיי התיקון בפנקס המפתח על בסיס CPE/CVE. מקבל קלט הזנת CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "הקשר נכס (נתיבים ציבוריים, תלויות, בעלים)", "code findings with file and line" "ממצאי קוד עם קובץ ושורה", "component shipped" "רכיב סופק", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "מיפוי רציף של משטח התקיפה החיצוני ומצאי נכסים", "dynamic probing of running applications" "בדיקה דינמית של אפליקציות פעילות", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "אירועי חשיפה המוזנים לפנקס VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "דה-דופליקציה של ממצאים (מפתח נכס × פגיעות)", "gated" "מוגבל", "inputs: " "קלטים: ", "outputs: " "פלטים: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "בדיקה עם תרחישים מאומתים", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "ניקוד נגישות × ניתנות לניצול", "reachable attack-path identification" "זיהוי נתיבי תקיפה נגישים", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "מחזור חיי תיקון (זוהה ← בטיפול ← אומת ← נסגר)", "role: " "תפקיד: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "איתור פגיעויות בזמן ריצה כממצאים", "static source-code analysis" "ניתוח סטטי של קוד המקור", "taint / data-flow inspection" "בדיקת זרימת מידע / taint", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "פנקס פגיעויות ממופה לפי CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} דיווחים לא מאושרים מהעבר. לא מספר הקרבנות המאושרים.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} פריטים · {claims} טענות מתועדות · אוחזר {date} "}, :hi {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "यह पहला स्नैपशॉट है। इसमें KEV की नवीनतम 50 प्रविष्टियाँ, ATT&CK के तीन समूह उनकी तकनीकों के साथ, और OTRF के सार्वजनिक लैब लॉग शामिल हैं। SCAP विनिर्देशों की एक कैटलॉग है, न कि कोई मूल्यांकन इंजन या चेक परिभाषाओं का पूरा सेट। स्वचालित अपडेट सेट नहीं किए गए हैं।", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "यह एक प्रकाशित लैब ऑडिट लॉग है। यह कोई वास्तविक घटना नहीं है।", "All" "सभी", "CID of this record" "इस रेकॉर्ड का CID", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM हमला पथ और एसेट संदर्भ को VM लेजर को देता है; ये पहुँच-क्षमता स्कोर का आधार होते हैं।", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "CVE/CPE फ़ीड इनटेक", "Capability" "क्षमता", "Catalog" "कैटलॉग", "Chat" "चैट", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "कंटीन्युअस थ्रेट एक्सपोज़र मैनेजमेंट। यह बाहरी हमला सतह और एंट्री पॉइंट्स की निरंतर गणना करता है, और हमला पथ व एसेट संदर्भ को VM लेजर को देता है।", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "डेटा लोड नहीं हो सका। कृपया बाद में पुनः प्रयास करें।", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST पुन: उत्पन्न किए जा सकने वाले रनटाइम निष्कर्ष (रिक्वेस्ट/रिस्पॉन्स प्रमाण) VM लेजर को भेजता है।", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "VM लेजर में डेटाफ़्लो", "Datomic schema" "Datomic स्कीमा", "Description" "विवरण", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "डायनैमिक एप्लिकेशन सिक्योरिटी टेस्टिंग। यह चल रहे एप्लिकेशन की जाँच करता है और रनटाइम निष्कर्ष VM लेजर को रिपोर्ट करता है।", "Encyclopedia" "एनसाइक्लोपीडिया", "Full record" "पूरा रेकॉर्ड", "Group" "समूह", "Groups" "समूह", "Guide for LLMs" "LLM के लिए मार्गदर्शिका", "History (unconfirmed)" "इतिहास (अपुष्ट)", "History data {n} " "इतिहास डेटा {n} ", "Home" "होम", "IPLD manifest" "IPLD मेनिफेस्ट", "Item details" "आइटम का विवरण", "Kind of data" "डेटा का प्रकार", "Loading the data…" "डेटा लोड हो रहा है…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "MITRE ATT&CK उपयोग की शर्तें", "No matching items." "कोई मिलान वाला आइटम नहीं मिला।", "OTRF terms of use" "OTRF उपयोग की शर्तें", "Ontology" "ऑन्टोलॉजी", "Public data" "सार्वजनिक डेटा", "Public lab log" "सार्वजनिक लैब लॉग", "Public logs" "सार्वजनिक लॉग", "Read the audit log" "ऑडिट लॉग पढ़ें", "Research with this evidence" "इस प्रमाण के साथ शोध करें", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST फ़ाइल और लाइन सहित कोड निष्कर्ष VM लेजर को भेजता है, जिससे फिक्स का लक्ष्य तेज़ी से मिल जाता है।", "Scenario and assumptions" "परिदृश्य और मान्यताएँ", "Scope and how the data is collected" "दायरा और डेटा एकत्र करने का तरीका", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "CVE, ATT&CK ID या नाम से खोजें", "Search the data" "डेटा खोजें", "Security public data" "सिक्योरिटी पब्लिक डेटा", "Security services" "सिक्योरिटी सर्विसेज़", "Snapshot CID" "स्नैपशॉट CID", "Source and archive" "स्रोत और आर्काइव", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "स्रोत-युक्त दावों, प्रेक्षित लॉग और विश्लेषण सिनेरियोज़ को अलग-अलग रखा जाता है। केवल KEV लिस्टिंग से यह तय नहीं होता कि किसी विशेष एसेट में वल्नरेबिलिटी है या किसी हमलावर का नाम बताया जा सके।", "Sourced relations" "स्रोत-युक्त संबंध", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "स्टैटिक एप्लिकेशन सिक्योरिटी टेस्टिंग: सोर्स कोड का विश्लेषण करके वल्नरेबल पैटर्न और मिसिंग सैनिटाइज़ेशन का पता लगाता है, और कोड फाइंडिंग्स को VM लेजर में रिपोर्ट करता है।", "Technique" "तकनीक", "Techniques" "तकनीकें", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "IPLD CIDs ही सोर्स ऑफ ट्रुथ हैं; JSON-LD और Datomic रूप उसी डेटा से जनरेट किए जाते हैं। ब्लॉक्स HTTPS पर सर्व किए जाते हैं। IPFS नेटवर्क पर डिस्ट्रीब्यूशन और एनसाइक्लोपीडिया के एकल ref के अंतर्गत रजिस्ट्रेशन अलग चरण हैं।", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "kotoba.cloud पर फर्स्ट-पार्टी सिक्योरिटी सर्विसेज़ सूट। CTEM, DAST और SAST फाइंडिंग्स एक साझा स्कीमा में VM लेजर में प्रवाहित होती हैं।", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "स्रोत रेकॉर्ड मूल URL, फ़ेच समय और आर्काइव किए गए टेक्स्ट तक ले जाता है।", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "तीन अपस्ट्रीम सेवाएँ साझा-स्कीमा फाइंडिंग्स जारी करती हैं; VM उन्हें डीड्यूप करता है, स्कोर करता है और रेमेडिएशन को ट्रैक करता है।", "This hub" "यह हब", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "यह पेज और GET /v1/security/services एक ही कैनोनिकल डेफिनिशन से रेंडर होते हैं। एनफोर्समेंट प्राइवेट अथॉरिटी पर ही रहता है; यह सतह केवल वर्णन करती है।", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "यह सिनेरियो एक विश्लेषण टेम्पलेट है, कोई प्रेक्षण नहीं।", "Threat model" "थ्रेट मॉडल", "Threat models" "थ्रेट मॉडल", "VM integration: " "VM इंटीग्रेशन: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM लेजर सेवा है: यह तीन अपस्ट्रीम सेवाओं की फाइंडिंग्स को साझा स्कीमा में प्राप्त करता है और उन्हें डीड्यूप करता है, स्कोर करता है और रेमेडिएशन को ट्रैक करता है।", "Vulnerabilities" "वल्नरेबिलिटीज़", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "वल्नरेबिलिटीज़, तकनीकें, समूह और लॉग — प्रत्येक अपने स्रोत तक ट्रेस किए जा सकते हैं।", "Vulnerability" "वल्नरेबिलिटी", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "वल्नरेबिलिटी मैनेजमेंट (wvme): तीन अपस्ट्रीम सेवाओं द्वारा जारी साझा-स्कीमा फाइंडिंग्स को ग्रहण करता है, उन्हें पहुँच-क्षमता (reachability) और शोषण-क्षमता (exploitability) के आधार पर डीड्यूप और स्कोर करता है, और CPE/CVE द्वारा कीड लेजर में रेमेडिएशन लाइफसाइकल को ट्रैक करता है। CVE/CPE फ़ीड इनपुट स्वीकार करता है।", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "एसेट कॉन्टेक्स्ट (पब्लिक रूट्स, डिपेंडेंसीज़, ओनर)", "code findings with file and line" "फ़ाइल और लाइन के साथ कोड फाइंडिंग्स", "component shipped" "कॉम्पोनेंट शिप्ड", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "निरंतर बाह्य अटैक-सरफेस और एसेट इन्वेंट्री", "dynamic probing of running applications" "चल रहे एप्लिकेशनों की डायनामिक प्रोबिंग", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "VM लेजर को फीड की गई एक्सपोज़र इवेंट्स", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "फाइंडिंग डीड्यूप्लिकेशन (एसेट × वल्नरेबिलिटी की)", "gated" "गेटेड", "inputs: " "इनपुट: ", "outputs: " "आउटपुट: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "ऑथेंटिकेटेड सिनेरियोज़ के साथ प्रोबिंग", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "पहुँच-क्षमता × शोषण-क्षमता स्कोरिंग", "reachable attack-path identification" "पहुँच-योग्य अटैक-पाथ की पहचान", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "रेमेडिएशन लाइफसाइकल (डिटेक्टेड → इन प्रोग्रेस → वेरिफाइड → क्लोज्ड)", "role: " "भूमिका: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "रनटाइम में सुभेद्यता का पता लगाकर निष्कर्ष के रूप में दर्ज करना", "static source-code analysis" "स्टैटिक सोर्स-कोड विश्लेषण", "taint / data-flow inspection" "टेंट / डेटा-फ़्लो निरीक्षण", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "CPE/CVE कुंजी वाला सुभेद्यता लेजर", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} पूर्व अपुष्ट रिपोर्ट। यह पुष्टि किए गए पीड़ितों की संख्या नहीं है।", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} आइटम · {claims} स्रोत-सहित दावे · प्राप्त {date} "}, :id {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Snapshot pertama: 50 entri KEV terbaru, tiga grup ATT&CK dengan teknik-tekniknya, dan log lab publik OTRF. SCAP adalah katalog spesifikasi, bukan mesin evaluasi atau kumpulan lengkap definisi pemeriksaan. Pembaruan otomatis belum dikonfigurasi.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Log audit lab yang dipublikasikan. Bukan insiden nyata.", "All" "Semua", "CID of this record" "CID dari rekaman ini", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM menyerahkan jalur serangan dan konteks aset ke ledger VM; keduanya menjadi dasar skor keterjangkauan (reachability score).", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "Pemasukan feed CVE/CPE", "Capability" "Kapabilitas", "Catalog" "Katalog", "Chat" "Obrolan", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: secara terus-menerus mendata permukaan serangan eksternal dan titik masuk, serta menyerahkan jalur serangan beserta konteks aset ke ledger VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "Data tidak dapat dimuat. Coba lagi nanti.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST mengeluarkan temuan runtime yang dapat direproduksi (bukti request/response) ke ledger VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Aliran data ke ledger VM", "Datomic schema" "Skema Datomic", "Description" "Deskripsi", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Dynamic application security testing: memeriksa aplikasi yang berjalan dan melaporkan temuan runtime ke ledger VM.", "Encyclopedia" "Ensiklopedia", "Full record" "Rekaman lengkap", "Group" "Grup", "Groups" "Grup", "Guide for LLMs" "Panduan untuk LLM", "History (unconfirmed)" "Riwayat (belum dikonfirmasi)", "History data {n} " "Data riwayat {n} ", "Home" "Beranda", "IPLD manifest" "Manifest IPLD", "Item details" "Detail item", "Kind of data" "Jenis data", "Loading the data…" "Memuat data…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "Ketentuan penggunaan MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "Tidak ada item yang cocok.", "OTRF terms of use" "Ketentuan penggunaan OTRF", "Ontology" "Ontologi", "Public data" "Data publik", "Public lab log" "Log lab publik", "Public logs" "Log publik", "Read the audit log" "Baca log audit", "Research with this evidence" "Teliti dengan bukti ini", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST mengeluarkan temuan kode beserta file dan baris ke ledger VM, sehingga target perbaikan dapat ditemukan lebih cepat.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Skenario dan asumsi", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Lingkup dan cara data dikumpulkan", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Cari berdasarkan CVE, ID ATT&CK, atau nama", "Search the data" "Cari data", "Security public data" "Data publik keamanan", "Security services" "Layanan keamanan", "Snapshot CID" "CID snapshot", "Source and archive" "Sumber dan arsip", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Klaim bersumber, log yang diamati, dan skenario analisis dipisahkan. Daftar KEV saja tidak pernah menentukan bahwa suatu aset tertentu rentan atau menyebut nama penyerang.", "Sourced relations" "Relasi bersumber", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Pengujian keamanan aplikasi statis: menganalisis kode sumber untuk mencari pola rentan dan sanitasi yang kurang, lalu melaporkan temuan kode ke ledger VM.", "Technique" "Teknik", "Techniques" "Teknik", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "CID IPLD adalah sumber kebenaran; bentuk JSON-LD dan Datomic dihasilkan dari data yang sama. Blok-blok disajikan melalui HTTPS. Distribusi ke jaringan IPFS dan registrasi di bawah ref tunggal ensiklopedia merupakan langkah-langkah terpisah.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "Rangkaian layanan keamanan pihak pertama di kotoba.cloud. Temuan CTEM, DAST, dan SAST mengalir ke ledger VM dalam satu skema bersama.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "Rekaman sumber mengarah ke URL asli, waktu pengambilan, dan teks yang diarsipkan.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "Ketiga layanan hulu menghasilkan temuan dengan skema bersama; VM melakukan deduplikasi, penilaian skor, dan pelacakan remediasi.", "This hub" "Hub ini", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Halaman ini dan GET /v1/security/services dirender dari satu definisi kanonik yang sama. Penerapan (enforcement) tetap berada pada authority privat; permukaan ini hanya bersifat deskriptif.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Skenario ini merupakan templat analisis, bukan hasil observasi.", "Threat model" "Model ancaman", "Threat models" "Model ancaman", "VM integration: " "Integrasi VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM adalah layanan ledger: menerima temuan dari ketiga layanan hulu dalam skema bersama, lalu melakukan deduplikasi, penilaian skor, dan pelacakan remediasi.", "Vulnerabilities" "Kerentanan", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Kerentanan, teknik, grup, dan log — masing-masing dapat dilacak ke sumbernya.", "Vulnerability" "Kerentanan", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Manajemen kerentanan (wvme): mengonsumsi temuan skema bersama yang dihasilkan oleh ketiga layanan hulu, melakukan deduplikasi dan penilaian skor berdasarkan reachability dan exploitability, serta melacak siklus hidup remediasi dalam ledger yang berkunci CPE/CVE. Menerima input feed CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "konteks aset (rute publik, dependensi, pemilik)", "code findings with file and line" "temuan kode dengan file dan baris", "component shipped" "komponen dirilis", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "inventarisasi berkelanjutan permukaan serangan eksternal dan aset", "dynamic probing of running applications" "pemeriksaan dinamis pada aplikasi yang berjalan", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "peristiwa eksposur yang dialirkan ke ledger VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "deduplikasi temuan (kunci aset × kerentanan)", "gated" "terbatas", "inputs: " "input: ", "outputs: " "output: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "pemeriksaan dengan skenario terautentikasi", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "penilaian skor reachability × exploitability", "reachable attack-path identification" "identifikasi jalur serangan yang dapat dijangkau", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "siklus hidup remediasi (terdeteksi → sedang berjalan → terverifikasi → ditutup)", "role: " "peran: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "deteksi kerentanan runtime sebagai temuan", "static source-code analysis" "analisis statis kode sumber", "taint / data-flow inspection" "inspeksi taint / aliran data", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "buku besar kerentanan berdasarkan kunci CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} laporan belum terkonfirmasi sebelumnya. Bukan jumlah korban yang terkonfirmasi.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} item · {claims} klaim bersumber · diambil {date} "}, :it {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Uno snapshot iniziale: le 50 voci KEV più recenti, tre gruppi ATT&CK con le relative tecniche e i log pubblici del laboratorio OTRF. SCAP è un catalogo di specifiche, non un motore di valutazione né l'insieme completo delle definizioni di controllo. Gli aggiornamenti automatici non sono configurati.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Un log di audit di laboratorio pubblicato. Non è un incidente reale.", "All" "Tutti", "CID of this record" "CID di questo record", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM trasferisce i percorsi di attacco e il contesto degli asset al registro VM; costituiscono la base del punteggio di raggiungibilità.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "Acquisizione feed CVE/CPE", "Capability" "Funzionalità", "Catalog" "Catalogo", "Chat" "Chat", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: enumera continuamente la superficie di attacco esterna e i punti di ingresso, e trasferisce i percorsi di attacco e il contesto degli asset al registro VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "Impossibile caricare i dati. Riprova più tardi.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST invia al registro VM risultati runtime riproducibili (prove di richiesta/risposta).", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Flusso di dati nel registro VM", "Datomic schema" "Schema Datomic", "Description" "Descrizione", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Dynamic application security testing: analizza le applicazioni in esecuzione e segnala i risultati runtime al registro VM.", "Encyclopedia" "Enciclopedia", "Full record" "Record completo", "Group" "Gruppo", "Groups" "Gruppi", "Guide for LLMs" "Guida per gli LLM", "History (unconfirmed)" "Cronologia (non confermata)", "History data {n} " "Dati storici {n} ", "Home" "Home", "IPLD manifest" "Manifesto IPLD", "Item details" "Dettagli elemento", "Kind of data" "Tipo di dati", "Loading the data…" "Caricamento dei dati…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "Termini di utilizzo di MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "Nessun elemento corrispondente.", "OTRF terms of use" "Termini di utilizzo di OTRF", "Ontology" "Ontologia", "Public data" "Dati pubblici", "Public lab log" "Log pubblico del laboratorio", "Public logs" "Log pubblici", "Read the audit log" "Leggi il log di audit", "Research with this evidence" "Ricerca con questa prova", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST invia al registro VM i risultati del codice con file e riga, così l'obiettivo della correzione viene individuato più rapidamente.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Scenario e ipotesi", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Ambito e modalità di raccolta dei dati", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Cerca per CVE, ID ATT&CK o nome", "Search the data" "Cerca nei dati", "Security public data" "Dati pubblici di sicurezza", "Security services" "Servizi di sicurezza", "Snapshot CID" "CID dello snapshot", "Source and archive" "Fonte e archivio", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Le affermazioni con fonte, i log osservati e gli scenari di analisi sono mantenuti separati. Una voce nell'elenco KEV, da sola, non determina mai che un determinato asset sia vulnerabile né identifica un attaccante.", "Sourced relations" "Relazioni con fonte", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Test statico di sicurezza delle applicazioni: analizza il codice sorgente per individuare pattern vulnerabili e sanificazione mancante, segnalando i risultati al registro VM.", "Technique" "Tecnica", "Techniques" "Tecniche", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "I CID IPLD sono la fonte di verità; le forme JSON-LD e Datomic sono generate a partire dai medesimi dati. I blocchi vengono serviti tramite HTTPS. La distribuzione alla rete IPFS e la registrazione sotto il ref unico dell'enciclopedia sono passaggi separati.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "La suite di servizi di sicurezza proprietari di kotoba.cloud. I risultati di CTEM, DAST e SAST confluiscono nel registro VM secondo uno schema condiviso.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "Il record della fonte porta all'URL originale, all'orario di recupero e al testo archiviato.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "I tre servizi upstream emettono risultati con schema condiviso; VM li deduplica, li valuta e ne traccia la risoluzione.", "This hub" "Questo hub", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Questa pagina e GET /v1/security/services vengono generate dalla stessa definizione canonica. L'applicazione (enforcement) resta di competenza dell'authority privata; questa superficie si limita a descrivere.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Questo scenario è un modello di analisi, non un'osservazione.", "Threat model" "Modello di minaccia", "Threat models" "Modelli di minaccia", "VM integration: " "Integrazione VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM è il servizio di registro: riceve i risultati dei tre servizi upstream secondo lo schema condiviso e ne effettua la deduplicazione, la valutazione e il tracciamento della risoluzione.", "Vulnerabilities" "Vulnerabilità", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Vulnerabilità, tecniche, gruppi e log — ognuno riconducibile alla propria fonte.", "Vulnerability" "Vulnerabilità", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Gestione delle vulnerabilità (wvme): riceve i risultati con schema condiviso emessi dai tre servizi upstream, li deduplica e li valuta in base a raggiungibilità e sfruttabilità, e ne traccia il ciclo di vita della risoluzione in un registro indicizzato per CPE/CVE. Accetta input da feed CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "contesto dell'asset (percorsi pubblici, dipendenze, proprietario)", "code findings with file and line" "rilevamento di risultati nel codice (file e riga)", "component shipped" "componente distribuito", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "inventario continuo della superficie di attacco esterna e degli asset", "dynamic probing of running applications" "verifica dinamica delle applicazioni in esecuzione", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "eventi di esposizione inviati al registro VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "deduplicazione dei risultati (chiave asset × vulnerabilità)", "gated" "con accesso controllato", "inputs: " "input: ", "outputs: " "output: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "verifica con scenari autenticati", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "valutazione raggiungibilità × sfruttabilità", "reachable attack-path identification" "identificazione dei percorsi di attacco raggiungibili", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "ciclo di vita della risoluzione (rilevato → in corso → verificato → chiuso)", "role: " "ruolo: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "rilevamento delle vulnerabilità a runtime come findings", "static source-code analysis" "analisi statica del codice sorgente", "taint / data-flow inspection" "ispezione taint / data-flow", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "registro delle vulnerabilità indicizzato per CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} segnalazioni passate non confermate. Non è un conteggio di vittime confermate.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} elementi · {claims} affermazioni con fonte · recuperato il {date} "}, :jv {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Snapshot pisanan: 50 entri KEV paling anyar, telung grup ATT&CK karo teknik-tekenike, lan log lab publik OTRF. SCAP iku katalog spesifikasi, dudu mesin evaluasi utawa sakabehe set definisi pamriksan. Update otomatis durung disetel.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Log audit lab sing diterbitake. Dudu insiden nyata.", "All" "Kabeh", "CID of this record" "CID rekaman iki", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM mènèhi jalur serangan lan konteks aset menyang buku besar VM; iki dadi dhasar skor reachability.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "Panampan feed CVE/CPE", "Capability" "Kapabilitas", "Catalog" "Katalog", "Chat" "Chat", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: terus-terusan nemtokake permukaan serangan eksternal lan titik mlebu, lan mènèhi jalur serangan plus konteks aset menyang buku besar VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "Ora bisa ngload data. Coba maneh ing wektu liya.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST ngasilake temuan runtime sing bisa diulang (bukti request/response) menyang buku besar VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Aliran data menyang buku besar VM", "Datomic schema" "Skema Datomic", "Description" "Katrangan", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Dynamic application security testing: mriksa aplikasi sing lagi mlaku lan nglapurake temuan runtime menyang buku besar VM.", "Encyclopedia" "Ensiklopedia", "Full record" "Rekaman lengkap", "Group" "Grup", "Groups" "Grup", "Guide for LLMs" "Pandhuan kanggo LLM", "History (unconfirmed)" "Riwayat (durung dikonfirmasi)", "History data {n} " "Data riwayat {n} ", "Home" "Ngarep", "IPLD manifest" "Manifest IPLD", "Item details" "Rincian item", "Kind of data" "Jinis data", "Loading the data…" "Ngload data…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "Sarat panggunaan MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "Ora ana item sing cocog.", "OTRF terms of use" "Sarat panggunaan OTRF", "Ontology" "Ontologi", "Public data" "Data publik", "Public lab log" "Log lab publik", "Public logs" "Log publik", "Read the audit log" "Waca log audit", "Research with this evidence" "Riset kanthi bukti iki", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST ngasilake temuan kode karo file lan baris menyang buku besar VM, saengga target dandanan luwih cepet ditemokake.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Skenario lan anggepan", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Jangkauan lan cara data dikumpulake", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Golek nganggo CVE, ID ATT&CK, utawa jeneng", "Search the data" "Golek data", "Security public data" "Data publik keamanan", "Security services" "Layanan keamanan", "Snapshot CID" "Snapshot CID", "Source and archive" "Sumber lan arsip", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Klaim kanthi sumber, log sing diamati, lan skenario analisis dipisahake. Dhaptar KEV wae ora tau nemtokake yen aset tartamtu rawan utawa nyebutake nama panyerang.", "Sourced relations" "Hubungan kanthi sumber", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Pengujian keamanan aplikasi statis: nganalisis kode sumber kanggo nemokake pola rawan lan sanitasi sing kurang, banjur nglaporake temuan kode menyang buku besar VM.", "Technique" "Teknik", "Techniques" "Teknik", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "CID IPLD dadi sumber kabeneran; wujud JSON-LD lan Datomic digawe saka data sing padha. Blok-blok kasebut dilayani liwat HTTPS. Distribusi menyang jaringan IPFS lan registrasi ing ref tunggal ensiklopedia iku langkah sing kapisah.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "Rangkaian layanan keamanan first-party ing kotoba.cloud. Temuan CTEM, DAST, lan SAST mili menyang buku besar VM ing siji skema bareng.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "Rekaman sumber ngarahake menyang URL asli, wektu pengambilan, lan teks sing diarsipake.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "Telung layanan upstream ngasilake temuan skema bareng; VM nglakoni dedup, nskoring, lan nglacak remediasi.", "This hub" "Hub iki", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Kaca iki lan GET /v1/security/services dirender saka siji definisi kanonikal. Penerapan (enforcement) tetep ana ing authority pribadi; permukaan iki mung njlentrehake.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Skenario iki minangka cithakan analisis, dudu asil pengamatan.", "Threat model" "Model ancaman", "Threat models" "Model ancaman", "VM integration: " "Integrasi VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM iku layanan buku besar: nampa temuan telung layanan upstream ing skema bareng lan nglakoni dedup, nskoring, lan nglacak remediasi.", "Vulnerabilities" "Kerentanan", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Kerentanan, teknik, grup, lan log — kabeh bisa dilacak menyang sumbere.", "Vulnerability" "Kerentanan", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Manajemen kerentanan (wvme): nampa temuan skema bareng sing digawe dening telung layanan upstream, nglakoni dedup lan nskoring adhedhasar reachability lan exploitability, lan nglacak siklus urip remediasi ing buku besar sing dikunci nganggo CPE/CVE. Nampa input feed CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "konteks aset (rute publik, dependensi, pemilik)", "code findings with file and line" "temuan kode kanthi file lan baris", "component shipped" "komponen wis dikirim", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "inventarisasi aset lan permukaan serangan eksternal sing terus-terusan", "dynamic probing of running applications" "pengujian dinamis aplikasi sing lagi mlaku", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "kedadean eksposur sing diumpakake menyang buku besar VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "dedup temuan (kunci aset × kerentanan)", "gated" "dikunci", "inputs: " "input: ", "outputs: " "output: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "pengujian kanthi skenario terotentikasi", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "nskoring reachability × exploitability", "reachable attack-path identification" "identifikasi jalur serangan sing bisa dijangkau", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "siklus urip remediasi (kedeteksi → lagi dikerjakan → wis diverifikasi → ditutup)", "role: " "peran: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "deteksi kerentanan runtime dadi temuan", "static source-code analysis" "analisis statis kode sumber", "taint / data-flow inspection" "inspeksi taint / data-flow", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "buku besar kerentanan kanthi kunci CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} laporan durung dikonfirmasi sadurunge. Ora nuduhake cacahing korban sing wis dikonfirmasi.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} item · {claims} klaim kanthi sumber · dijupuk {date} "}, :ko {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "첫 스냅샷입니다. KEV 최신 50건, ATT&CK 3개 그룹과 관련 기법, OTRF의 공개 랩 로그를 수록했습니다. SCAP은 사양 카탈로그이며 평가 엔진이나 전체 점검 정의가 아닙니다. 자동 업데이트는 설정되어 있지 않습니다.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "공개된 랩 감사 로그입니다. 실제 사고가 아닙니다.", "All" "전체", "CID of this record" "이 레코드의 CID", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM은 공격 경로와 자산 컨텍스트를 VM 원장에 전달하며, 이는 도달 가능성 점수의 근거가 됩니다.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "CVE/CPE 피드 입력", "Capability" "기능", "Catalog" "카탈로그", "Chat" "채팅", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "지속적 위협 노출 관리. 외부 공격 표면과 진입점을 지속적으로 식별하고, 공격 경로와 자산 컨텍스트를 VM 원장에 전달합니다.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "데이터를 불러올 수 없습니다. 잠시 후 다시 시도해 주세요.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST는 재현 가능한 런타임 결과(요청/응답 증거)를 VM 원장에 전달합니다.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "VM 원장으로의 데이터 흐름", "Datomic schema" "Datomic 스키마", "Description" "설명", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "동적 애플리케이션 보안 테스트. 실행 중인 애플리케이션을 검사하여 런타임 결과를 VM 원장에 보고합니다.", "Encyclopedia" "백과사전", "Full record" "전체 레코드", "Group" "그룹", "Groups" "그룹", "Guide for LLMs" "LLM용 이용 안내", "History (unconfirmed)" "이력 (미확인)", "History data {n} " "이력 데이터 {n} ", "Home" "홈", "IPLD manifest" "IPLD 매니페스트", "Item details" "항목 세부정보", "Kind of data" "데이터 종류", "Loading the data…" "데이터를 불러오는 중…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "MITRE ATT&CK 이용 약관", "No matching items." "일치하는 항목이 없습니다.", "OTRF terms of use" "OTRF 이용 약관", "Ontology" "온톨로지", "Public data" "공개 데이터", "Public lab log" "공개 랩 로그", "Public logs" "공개 로그", "Read the audit log" "감사 로그 읽기", "Research with this evidence" "이 근거로 조사하기", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST는 파일 및 라인 정보가 포함된 코드 결과를 VM 원장에 전달하여 수정 대상을 더 빠르게 찾을 수 있게 합니다.", "Scenario and assumptions" "시나리오 및 가정", "Scope and how the data is collected" "데이터 범위 및 수집 방법", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "CVE, ATT&CK ID 또는 이름으로 검색", "Search the data" "데이터 검색", "Security public data" "보안 공개 데이터", "Security services" "보안 서비스", "Snapshot CID" "스냅샷 CID", "Source and archive" "출처 및 아카이브", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "출처가 있는 주장, 관측된 로그, 분석용 시나리오를 서로 구분합니다. KEV 등재만으로는 특정 자산의 취약성이나 공격자를 단정하지 않습니다.", "Sourced relations" "출처가 있는 관계", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "정적 애플리케이션 보안 테스트: 소스 코드를 분석하여 취약한 패턴과 누락된 새니타이징을 탐지하고, 코드 발견 항목을 VM 원장에 보고합니다.", "Technique" "공격 기법", "Techniques" "공격 기법", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "IPLD CID가 정본이며, JSON-LD 및 Datomic 형식은 동일한 데이터로부터 생성됩니다. 블록은 HTTPS로 제공됩니다. IPFS 네트워크로의 배포와 백과사전의 단일 ref 등록은 별도 단계입니다.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "kotoba.cloud의 자체 보안 서비스 모음입니다. CTEM, DAST, SAST 발견 항목은 하나의 공통 스키마로 VM 원장에 집계됩니다.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "출처 레코드에서 원본 URL, 수집 시각, 보관된 원문으로 이동할 수 있습니다.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "상류 3개 서비스가 공통 스키마의 발견 항목을 생성하며, VM이 중복 제거·점수화·수정 추적을 수행합니다.", "This hub" "이 허브", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "이 페이지와 GET /v1/security/services는 동일한 정본 정의로부터 렌더링됩니다. 실행(enforcement)은 비공개 authority가 담당하며, 이 화면은 설명만 제공합니다.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "이 시나리오는 분석용 템플릿이며, 관측 사실이 아닙니다.", "Threat model" "위협 모델", "Threat models" "위협 모델", "VM integration: " "VM 통합: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM은 원장 서비스입니다: 상류 3개 서비스의 발견 항목을 공통 스키마로 받아 중복 제거·점수화·수정 추적을 수행합니다.", "Vulnerabilities" "취약점", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "취약점, 공격 기법, 그룹, 로그 — 각각 출처까지 추적 가능합니다.", "Vulnerability" "취약점", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "취약점 관리(wvme): 3개 상류 서비스가 발행한 공통 스키마 발견 항목을 받아, 도달 가능성과 악용 가능성으로 중복 제거 및 점수화하고, CPE/CVE 키 기반 원장에서 수정 생명주기를 추적합니다. CVE/CPE 피드 입력을 허용합니다.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "자산 컨텍스트(공개 경로·의존성·소유자) 부여", "code findings with file and line" "코드 발견 항목(파일 및 라인) 탐지", "component shipped" "컴포넌트 제공 중", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "외부 공격 표면 및 자산 인벤토리의 지속적 열거", "dynamic probing of running applications" "실행 중인 애플리케이션에 대한 동적 검사", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "노출 이벤트의 VM 원장 전송", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "발견 항목 중복 제거(자산 × 취약점 키)", "gated" "게이트 중", "inputs: " "입력: ", "outputs: " "출력: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "인증 시나리오 기반 검사", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "도달 가능성 × 악용 가능성 점수화", "reachable attack-path identification" "도달 가능한 공격 경로 식별", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "수정 생명주기(감지 → 진행 중 → 확인됨 → 종료)", "role: " "역할: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "실행 시 취약점 탐지 및 소견화", "static source-code analysis" "소스코드 정적 분석", "taint / data-flow inspection" "데이터플로우 검사(taint)", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "CPE/CVE 기반 취약점 원장", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "과거 미확인 신고 {count}건. 확인된 피해 건수가 아닙니다.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items}개 항목 · 출처 있는 주장 {claims}건 · 가져온 시각 {date} "}, :mr {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "ही पहिली स्नॅपशॉट आहे: KEV मधील नवीनतम 50 नोंदी, ATT&CK च्या तीन गट व त्यांच्या तंत्रे, आणि OTRF चे सार्वजनिक लॅब लॉग्ज यांचा समावेश आहे. SCAP हे तपशीलांचे कॅटलॉग आहे, मूल्यांकन इंजिन किंवा सर्व तपासणी व्याख्यांचा संपूर्ण संच नाही. स्वयंचलित अद्यतने कॉन्फिगर केलेली नाहीत.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "प्रकाशित लॅब ऑडिट लॉग. ही खरी घटना नाही.", "All" "सर्व", "CID of this record" "या नोंदीचा CID", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM हल्ल्याचे मार्ग आणि मालमत्तेचा संदर्भ VM लेजरकडे देते; हे पोहोच स्कोअरचा आधार असतात.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "CVE/CPE फीड इनटेक", "Capability" "क्षमता", "Catalog" "कॅटलॉग", "Chat" "चॅट", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "सतत धोका उघडकीस व्यवस्थापन: बाहेरील हल्ला पृष्ठभाग व प्रवेश बिंदू सतत सूचीबद्ध करते, आणि हल्ल्याचे मार्ग व मालमत्तेचा संदर्भ VM लेजरकडे देते.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "डेटा लोड करता आला नाही. कृपया नंतर पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST पुनरुत्पादनक्षम रनटाइम निष्कर्ष (request/response पुरावा) VM लेजरकडे पाठवते.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "VM लेजरमध्ये डेटाफ्लो", "Datomic schema" "Datomic स्कीमा", "Description" "वर्णन", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "डायनॅमिक ऍप्लिकेशन सुरक्षा चाचणी: चालू असलेल्या ऍप्लिकेशन्सची तपासणी करते आणि रनटाइम निष्कर्ष VM लेजरकडे नोंदवते.", "Encyclopedia" "ज्ञानकोश", "Full record" "संपूर्ण नोंद", "Group" "गट", "Groups" "गट", "Guide for LLMs" "LLM साठी मार्गदर्शक", "History (unconfirmed)" "इतिहास (अपुष्ट)", "History data {n} " "इतिहास डेटा {n} ", "Home" "मुख्यपृष्ठ", "IPLD manifest" "IPLD मॅनिफेस्ट", "Item details" "वस्तूचा तपशील", "Kind of data" "डेटाचा प्रकार", "Loading the data…" "डेटा लोड होत आहे…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "MITRE ATT&CK वापर अटी", "No matching items." "जुळणाऱ्या वस्तू नाहीत.", "OTRF terms of use" "OTRF वापर अटी", "Ontology" "ऑन्टोलॉजी", "Public data" "सार्वजनिक डेटा", "Public lab log" "सार्वजनिक लॅब लॉग", "Public logs" "सार्वजनिक लॉग्ज", "Read the audit log" "ऑडिट लॉग वाचा", "Research with this evidence" "या पुराव्यासह संशोधन करा", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST फाईल व ओळ क्रमांकासह कोड निष्कर्ष VM लेजरकडे पाठवते, त्यामुळे दुरुस्तीचे लक्ष्य वेगाने सापडते.", "Scenario and assumptions" "परिस्थिती व गृहीतके", "Scope and how the data is collected" "व्याप्ती व डेटा संकलनाची पद्धत", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "CVE, ATT&CK id किंवा नावाने शोधा", "Search the data" "डेटा शोधा", "Security public data" "सुरक्षा सार्वजनिक डेटा", "Security services" "सुरक्षा सेवा", "Snapshot CID" "स्नॅपशॉट CID", "Source and archive" "स्रोत आणि आर्काइव्ह", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "स्रोतबद्ध दावे, निरीक्षण केलेले लॉग्स आणि विश्लेषण परिस्थिती वेगळे ठेवली जातात. केवळ KEV सूचीकरण एकट्याने कोणतीही विशिष्ट अ‍ॅसेट व्हल्नरेबल आहे किंवा आक्रमणकर्त्याचे नाव ठरवत नाही.", "Sourced relations" "स्रोतबद्ध संबंध", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "स्टॅटिक अ‍ॅप्लिकेशन सिक्युरिटी टेस्टिंग: स्रोत कोडमधील व्हल्नरेबल पॅटर्न्स आणि सॅनिटायझेशनच्या कमतरतेचे विश्लेषण करते आणि कोड निष्कर्ष VM लेजरला अहवाल देते.", "Technique" "तंत्र", "Techniques" "तंत्रे", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "IPLD CIDs हे सत्याचे स्रोत आहेत; JSON-LD आणि Datomic स्वरूपे त्याच डेटामधून जनरेट केली जातात. ब्लॉक्स HTTPS वरून सर्व्ह केले जातात. IPFS नेटवर्कला वितरण आणि एन्सायक्लोपीडियाच्या एकल रेफ अंतर्गत नोंदणी हे स्वतंत्र टप्पे आहेत.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "kotoba.cloud वरील फर्स्ट-पार्टी सुरक्षा सेवा सूट. CTEM, DAST आणि SAST निष्कर्ष एका शेअर्ड स्कीमामध्ये VM लेजरमध्ये वाहतात.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "स्रोत रेकॉर्ड मूळ URL, फेच वेळ आणि आर्काइव्ह केलेल्या मजकुरापर्यंत नेतो.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "तीन अपस्ट्रीम सेवा शेअर्ड-स्कीमा निष्कर्ष जारी करतात; VM डिड्युप्लिकेशन, स्कोअरिंग आणि निवारण ट्रॅकिंग करते.", "This hub" "हे हब", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "हे पेज आणि GET /v1/security/services एका कॅनॉनिकल डेफ मधून रेंडर होतात. एनफोर्समेंट खासगी अथॉरिटीकडेच राहते; हे पृष्ठ केवळ वर्णन करते.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "ही परिस्थिती एक विश्लेषण टेम्पलेट आहे, निरीक्षण नाही.", "Threat model" "थ्रेट मॉडेल", "Threat models" "थ्रेट मॉडेल्स", "VM integration: " "VM एकत्रीकरण: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM ही लेजर सेवा आहे: ती तीन अपस्ट्रीम सेवांचे निष्कर्ष शेअर्ड स्कीमामध्ये स्वीकारते आणि डिड्युप्लिकेशन, स्कोअरिंग व निवारण ट्रॅकिंग करते.", "Vulnerabilities" "व्हल्नरेबिलिटीज", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "व्हल्नरेबिलिटीज, तंत्रे, गट आणि लॉग्स — प्रत्येक त्याच्या स्रोतापर्यंत ट्रेस करण्यायोग्य.", "Vulnerability" "व्हल्नरेबिलिटी", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "व्हल्नरेबिलिटी मॅनेजमेंट (wvme): तीन अपस्ट्रीम सेवांनी जारी केलेले शेअर्ड-स्कीमा निष्कर्ष स्वीकारते, ते रिचेबिलिटी आणि एक्स्प्लॉइटेबिलिटीच्या आधारे डिड्युप्लिकेट व स्कोअर करते, आणि CPE/CVE-कीड लेजरमध्ये निवारण लाइफसायकल ट्रॅक करते. CVE/CPE फीड इनपुट स्वीकारते.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "अ‍ॅसेट संदर्भ (सार्वजनिक मार्ग, डिपेंडन्सी, मालक)", "code findings with file and line" "फाइल आणि लाइनसह कोड निष्कर्ष", "component shipped" "घटक शिप केला", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "सतत बाह्य अटॅक-सरफेस आणि अ‍ॅसेट इन्व्हेंटरी", "dynamic probing of running applications" "चालू असलेल्या अ‍ॅप्लिकेशन्सचे डायनॅमिक प्रोबिंग", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "VM लेजरला दिले जाणारे एक्सपोजर इव्हेंट्स", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "निष्कर्ष डिड्युप्लिकेशन (अ‍ॅसेट × व्हल्नरेबिलिटी की)", "gated" "गेटेड", "inputs: " "इनपुट: ", "outputs: " "आउटपुट: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "प्रमाणित परिस्थितींसह प्रोबिंग", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "रिचेबिलिटी × एक्स्प्लॉइटेबिलिटी स्कोअरिंग", "reachable attack-path identification" "रिचेबल अटॅक-पाथ ओळख", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "निवारण लाइफसायकल (सापडले → प्रगतीत → सत्यापित → बंद)", "role: " "भूमिका: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "रनटाइम असुरक्षितता शोध आणि निष्कर्ष म्हणून नोंद", "static source-code analysis" "स्टॅटिक सोर्स-कोड विश्लेषण", "taint / data-flow inspection" "टेंट / डेटा-फ्लो तपासणी", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "CPE/CVE नुसार निर्देशांकित असुरक्षितता लेजर", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "मागील {count} अपुष्ट अहवाल. पुष्टी झालेल्या बळींची संख्या नाही.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} आयटम · {claims} स्रोतासहित दावे · प्राप्त {date} "}, :pcm {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Dis na di first snapshot: di 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups wit dia techniques, and OTRF public lab logs. SCAP na catalog of specifications, e no be evaluation engine or di full set of check definitions. Automatic updates no dey configure.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Na published lab audit log. E no be real incident.", "All" "All", "CID of this record" "CID of dis record", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM dey hand attack paths and asset context give VM ledger; dem be di basis for reachability score.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "CVE/CPE feed intake", "Capability" "Capability", "Catalog" "Catalog", "Chat" "Chat", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: e dey continuously count external attack surface and entry points, and e dey hand attack paths plus asset context give VM ledger.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "We no fit load di data. Try again later.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST dey send reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) go VM ledger.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "How data dey flow enter VM ledger", "Datomic schema" "Datomic schema", "Description" "Description", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Dynamic application security testing: e dey probe applications wey dey run and e dey report runtime findings go VM ledger.", "Encyclopedia" "Ensaiklopidia", "Full record" "Full record", "Group" "Group", "Groups" "Groups", "Guide for LLMs" "Guide for LLMs", "History (unconfirmed)" "History (we neva confirm)", "History data {n} " "Data history {n} ", "Home" "Home", "IPLD manifest" "IPLD manifest", "Item details" "Detail of item", "Kind of data" "Type of data", "Loading the data…" "Dey load di data…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use", "No matching items." "No item match.", "OTRF terms of use" "OTRF terms of use", "Ontology" "Ontology", "Public data" "Public data", "Public lab log" "Public lab log", "Public logs" "Public logs", "Read the audit log" "Read di audit log", "Research with this evidence" "Use dis evidence do research", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST dey send code findings wit file and line go VM ledger, so dem go fit find di fix target faster.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Scenario and wetin we assume", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Scope and how dem dey collect di data", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name", "Search the data" "Search the data", "Security public data" "Security public data", "Security services" "Security services", "Snapshot CID" "Snapshot CID", "Source and archive" "Source and archive", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Sourced claims, logs wey dem observe, and analysis scenarios, dem dey keep dem separate. KEV listing alone no fit decide say particular asset dey vulnerable or name attacker.", "Sourced relations" "Sourced relations", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Static application security testing: e dey analyze source code to find vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, then report code findings go the VM ledger.", "Technique" "Technique", "Techniques" "Techniques", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "The IPLD CIDs na the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms dem generate from the same data. Dem dey serve the blocks over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia single ref, na separate steps.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "Na the first-party security services suite wey dey for kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings dey flow enter the VM ledger wit one shared schema.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "The source record go lead you go the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "The three upstream services dey emit findings wit shared-schema; VM dey dedup dem, score dem, and track how dem dey fix am.", "This hub" "This hub", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "This page and GET /v1/security/services dey render from the one canonical def. Enforcement dey stay wit the private authority; this surface na just to describe.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "This scenario na analysis template, e no be observation.", "Threat model" "Threat model", "Threat models" "Threat models", "VM integration: " "VM integration: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM na the ledger service: e dey receive the findings of the three upstream services inside shared schema, e dey dedup dem, score dem, and track remediation.", "Vulnerabilities" "Vulnerabilities", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — everyone fit trace back to where e come from.", "Vulnerability" "Vulnerability", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Vulnerability management (wvme): e dey take the shared-schema findings wey the three upstream services emit, dedup and score dem based on reachability and exploitability, then track the remediation lifecycle inside ledger wey dem key by CPE/CVE. E dey accept CVE/CPE feed input.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)", "code findings with file and line" "code findings wit file and line", "component shipped" "component wey dem don ship", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory", "dynamic probing of running applications" "dynamic probing of applications wey dey run", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "exposure events wey dem feed enter the VM ledger", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)", "gated" "gated", "inputs: " "inputs: ", "outputs: " "outputs: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "probing wit authenticated scenarios", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "reachability × exploitability scoring", "reachable attack-path identification" "identification of attack-path wey dem fit reach", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)", "role: " "role: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "detect runtime vulnerability turn am to findings", "static source-code analysis" "static analysis for source-code", "taint / data-flow inspection" "taint / data-flow inspection", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "vulnerability ledger wey dem key with CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} unconfirmed report wey pass. E no be count of victim wey dem confirm.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} items · {claims} claims wey get source · dem fetch am {date} "}, :pt {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Um primeiro snapshot: as 50 entradas mais recentes do KEV, três grupos do ATT&CK com suas técnicas e os registros públicos de laboratório da OTRF. O SCAP é um catálogo de especificações, não um mecanismo de avaliação nem o conjunto completo de definições de verificação. As atualizações automáticas não estão configuradas.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Um registro de auditoria de laboratório publicado. Não é um incidente real.", "All" "Todos", "CID of this record" "CID deste registro", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "O CTEM entrega caminhos de ataque e contexto de ativos ao registro de VM; eles são a base da pontuação de acessibilidade.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "Ingestão do feed CVE/CPE", "Capability" "Capacidade", "Catalog" "Catálogo", "Chat" "Chat", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Gerenciamento Contínuo de Exposição a Ameaças: enumera continuamente a superfície de ataque externa e os pontos de entrada, e entrega caminhos de ataque e contexto de ativos ao registro de VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "Não foi possível carregar os dados. Tente novamente mais tarde.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "O DAST emite descobertas reproduzíveis em tempo de execução (evidências de requisição/resposta) para o registro de VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Fluxo de dados para o registro de VM", "Datomic schema" "Esquema Datomic", "Description" "Descrição", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Teste dinâmico de segurança de aplicações: examina aplicações em execução e reporta descobertas em tempo de execução ao registro de VM.", "Encyclopedia" "Enciclopédia", "Full record" "Registro completo", "Group" "Grupo", "Groups" "Grupos", "Guide for LLMs" "Guia para LLMs", "History (unconfirmed)" "Histórico (não confirmado)", "History data {n} " "Dados do histórico {n} ", "Home" "Início", "IPLD manifest" "Manifesto IPLD", "Item details" "Detalhes do item", "Kind of data" "Tipo de dados", "Loading the data…" "Carregando os dados…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "Termos de uso do MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "Nenhum item correspondente.", "OTRF terms of use" "Termos de uso da OTRF", "Ontology" "Ontologia", "Public data" "Dados públicos", "Public lab log" "Registro público de laboratório", "Public logs" "Registros públicos", "Read the audit log" "Ler o registro de auditoria", "Research with this evidence" "Pesquisar com esta evidência", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "O SAST emite descobertas de código com arquivo e linha para o registro de VM, para que o alvo da correção seja encontrado mais rápido.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Cenário e premissas", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Escopo e como os dados são coletados", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Pesquisar por CVE, ID do ATT&CK ou nome", "Search the data" "Pesquisar os dados", "Security public data" "Dados públicos de segurança", "Security services" "Serviços de segurança", "Snapshot CID" "CID do snapshot", "Source and archive" "Origem e arquivo", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Afirmações com origem, registros observados e cenários de análise são mantidos separados. Uma listagem KEV isolada nunca determina que um ativo específico é vulnerável nem identifica um atacante.", "Sourced relations" "Relações com origem", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Teste estático de segurança de aplicações: analisa o código-fonte em busca de padrões vulneráveis e sanitização ausente, reportando descobertas de código ao registro do VM.", "Technique" "Técnica", "Techniques" "Técnicas", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "Os CIDs do IPLD são a fonte da verdade; as formas em JSON-LD e Datomic são geradas a partir dos mesmos dados. Os blocos são servidos via HTTPS. A distribuição para a rede IPFS e o registro sob a referência única da enciclopédia são etapas separadas.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "O conjunto de serviços de segurança próprios do kotoba.cloud. As descobertas de CTEM, DAST e SAST fluem para o registro do VM em um único esquema compartilhado.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "O registro de origem leva à URL original, ao horário de captura e ao texto arquivado.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "Os três serviços upstream emitem descobertas em esquema compartilhado; o VM deduplica, pontua e acompanha a correção.", "This hub" "Este hub", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Esta página e GET /v1/security/services são renderizadas a partir da mesma definição canônica. A aplicação (enforcement) permanece na autoridade privada; esta superfície apenas descreve.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Este cenário é um modelo de análise, não uma observação.", "Threat model" "Modelo de ameaça", "Threat models" "Modelos de ameaça", "VM integration: " "Integração com VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "O VM é o serviço de registro: recebe as descobertas dos três serviços upstream no esquema compartilhado e deduplica, pontua e acompanha a correção.", "Vulnerabilities" "Vulnerabilidades", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Vulnerabilidades, técnicas, grupos e registros — cada um rastreável até a sua origem.", "Vulnerability" "Vulnerabilidade", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Gestão de vulnerabilidades (wvme): consome as descobertas em esquema compartilhado emitidas pelos três serviços upstream, deduplica e pontua-as por alcançabilidade e explorabilidade, e acompanha o ciclo de vida da correção em um registro indexado por CPE/CVE. Aceita entrada de feed CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "contexto do ativo (rotas públicas, dependências, responsável)", "code findings with file and line" "descobertas de código com arquivo e linha", "component shipped" "componente disponibilizado", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "inventário contínuo de superfície de ataque externa e ativos", "dynamic probing of running applications" "sondagem dinâmica de aplicações em execução", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "eventos de exposição enviados ao registro do VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "deduplicação de descobertas (chave ativo × vulnerabilidade)", "gated" "restrito", "inputs: " "entradas: ", "outputs: " "saídas: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "sondagem com cenários autenticados", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "pontuação de alcançabilidade × explorabilidade", "reachable attack-path identification" "identificação de caminhos de ataque alcançáveis", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "ciclo de vida da correção (detectado → em andamento → verificado → encerrado)", "role: " "função: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "detecção de vulnerabilidades em runtime como findings", "static source-code analysis" "análise estática de código-fonte", "taint / data-flow inspection" "inspeção de taint / fluxo de dados", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "registro de vulnerabilidades indexado por CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} denúncias não confirmadas anteriores. Não é uma contagem de vítimas confirmadas.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} itens · {claims} alegações com fonte · obtido em {date} "}, :ru {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Первый снимок данных: 50 последних записей KEV, три группы ATT&CK с их техниками и публичные лабораторные журналы OTRF. SCAP — это каталог спецификаций, а не движок оценки или полный набор определений проверок. Автоматические обновления не настроены.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Опубликованный лабораторный журнал аудита. Не реальный инцидент.", "All" "Все", "CID of this record" "CID этой записи", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM передаёт пути атак и контекст активов в реестр VM; они лежат в основе оценки достижимости.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "Приём фида CVE/CPE", "Capability" "Возможность", "Catalog" "Каталог", "Chat" "Чат", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: непрерывно выявляет внешнюю поверхность атаки и точки входа, передавая пути атак и контекст активов в реестр VM.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "Не удалось загрузить данные. Повторите попытку позже.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST передаёт воспроизводимые результаты выполнения (доказательства запросов и ответов) в реестр VM.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Поток данных в реестр VM", "Datomic schema" "Схема Datomic", "Description" "Описание", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Динамическое тестирование безопасности приложений: анализирует работающие приложения и передаёт результаты выполнения в реестр VM.", "Encyclopedia" "Энциклопедия", "Full record" "Полная запись", "Group" "Группа", "Groups" "Группы", "Guide for LLMs" "Руководство для LLM", "History (unconfirmed)" "История (неподтверждено)", "History data {n} " "Данные истории {n} ", "Home" "Главная", "IPLD manifest" "Манифест IPLD", "Item details" "Сведения об элементе", "Kind of data" "Тип данных", "Loading the data…" "Загрузка данных…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "Условия использования MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "Совпадений не найдено.", "OTRF terms of use" "Условия использования OTRF", "Ontology" "Онтология", "Public data" "Публичные данные", "Public lab log" "Публичный лабораторный журнал", "Public logs" "Публичные журналы", "Read the audit log" "Читать журнал аудита", "Research with this evidence" "Исследовать с этим доказательством", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST передаёт результаты анализа кода с указанием файла и строки в реестр VM, что ускоряет поиск цели для исправления.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Сценарий и допущения", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Область и способ сбора данных", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Поиск по CVE, ATT&CK ID или названию", "Search the data" "Поиск по данным", "Security public data" "Публичные данные по безопасности", "Security services" "Сервисы безопасности", "Snapshot CID" "CID снимка", "Source and archive" "Источник и архив", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Утверждения с источником, наблюдаемые журналы и аналитические сценарии хранятся раздельно. Одно лишь наличие записи в KEV не определяет уязвимость конкретного актива и не указывает на конкретного атакующего.", "Sourced relations" "Связи с указанием источника", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Статическое тестирование безопасности приложений: анализирует исходный код на наличие уязвимых паттернов и отсутствие санитизации, передавая findings по коду в журнал VM.", "Technique" "Техника", "Techniques" "Техники", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "CID в IPLD являются источником истины; формы JSON-LD и Datomic генерируются из тех же данных. Блоки предоставляются по HTTPS. Распространение в сети IPFS и регистрация под единым ref энциклопедии — отдельные этапы.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "Набор собственных сервисов безопасности на kotoba.cloud. Findings от CTEM, DAST и SAST поступают в журнал VM в единой общей схеме.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "Запись источника ведёт к исходному URL, времени получения и заархивированному тексту.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "Три вышестоящих сервиса формируют findings в единой схеме; VM выполняет дедупликацию, скоринг и отслеживание устранения.", "This hub" "Этот хаб", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Эта страница и GET /v1/security/services формируются из одного канонического определения. Применение (enforcement) остаётся на стороне закрытого authority; этот интерфейс только описывает.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Этот сценарий — шаблон анализа, а не наблюдаемый факт.", "Threat model" "Модель угроз", "Threat models" "Модели угроз", "VM integration: " "Интеграция с VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM — это сервис-журнал: он принимает findings трёх вышестоящих сервисов в единой схеме, выполняет дедупликацию, скоринг и отслеживание устранения.", "Vulnerabilities" "Уязвимости", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Уязвимости, техники, группы и журналы — каждый элемент можно проследить до источника.", "Vulnerability" "Уязвимость", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Управление уязвимостями (wvme). Принимает findings в единой схеме от трёх вышестоящих сервисов, выполняет их дедупликацию и скоринг по достижимости и эксплуатируемости, а также ведёт журнал жизненного цикла устранения с привязкой к CPE/CVE. Принимает входные данные из фида CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "контекст актива (публичные маршруты, зависимости, владелец)", "code findings with file and line" "обнаружение проблем в коде с указанием файла и строки", "component shipped" "компонент внедрён", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "непрерывная инвентаризация внешней поверхности атаки и активов", "dynamic probing of running applications" "динамическая проверка работающих приложений", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "события экспозиции, передаваемые в журнал VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "дедупликация findings (ключ актив × уязвимость)", "gated" "ограничено", "inputs: " "входные данные: ", "outputs: " "выходные данные: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "проверка по аутентифицированным сценариям", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "скоринг по достижимости × эксплуатируемости", "reachable attack-path identification" "выявление достижимых путей атаки", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "жизненный цикл устранения (обнаружено → в работе → проверено → закрыто)", "role: " "роль: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "обнаружение уязвимостей во время выполнения в виде находок", "static source-code analysis" "статический анализ исходного кода", "taint / data-flow inspection" "анализ потоков данных (taint)", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "реестр уязвимостей с ключом CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} прошлых неподтверждённых сообщений. Это не число подтверждённых пострадавших.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} элементов · {claims} подтверждённых утверждений · получено {date} "}, :su {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "Snapshot mimiti: 50 éntri KEV panganyarna, tilu grup ATT&CK jeung téhnikna, sarta log lab publik OTRF. SCAP mangrupa katalog spésifikasi, lain mesin évaluasi atawa sakumpulan lengkep definisi check. Update otomatis teu acan dikonfigurasi.", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "Log audit lab nu dipublikasikeun. Lain insiden nyata.", "All" "Sadaya", "CID of this record" "CID rékaman ieu", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM méré jalur panyerangan jeung konteks aset ka VM ledger; ieu jadi dasar skor reachability.", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "Panarimaan feed CVE/CPE", "Capability" "Kamampuh", "Catalog" "Katalog", "Chat" "Obrolan", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: sacara kontinu ngaenumerasi permukaan panyerangan éksternal jeung titik asup, tur méré jalur panyerangan sarta konteks aset ka VM ledger.", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "Data gagal dimuat. Cobi deui engké.", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST ngaluarkeun temuan runtime nu bisa direproduksi (bukti request/response) ka VM ledger.", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "Aliran data ka VM ledger", "Datomic schema" "Skema Datomic", "Description" "Katerangan", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "Dynamic application security testing: ngaperiksa aplikasi anu keur jalan tur ngalaporkeun temuan runtime ka VM ledger.", "Encyclopedia" "Énsiklopédia", "Full record" "Rékaman lengkep", "Group" "Grup", "Groups" "Grup", "Guide for LLMs" "Pituduh pikeun LLM", "History (unconfirmed)" "Riwayat (can dikonfirmasi)", "History data {n} " "Data riwayat {n} ", "Home" "Bumi", "IPLD manifest" "Manifest IPLD", "Item details" "Detil item", "Kind of data" "Jenis data", "Loading the data…" "Ngamuat data…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "Sarat panggunaan MITRE ATT&CK", "No matching items." "Teu aya item nu cocog.", "OTRF terms of use" "Sarat panggunaan OTRF", "Ontology" "Ontologi", "Public data" "Data publik", "Public lab log" "Log lab publik", "Public logs" "Log publik", "Read the audit log" "Baca log audit", "Research with this evidence" "Teliti kalawan bukti ieu", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST ngaluarkeun temuan kode kalawan file jeung baris ka VM ledger, sangkan target perbaikan gancang kapendak.", "Scenario and assumptions" "Skenario jeung asumsi", "Scope and how the data is collected" "Cakupan jeung cara data dikumpulkeun", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "Paluruh ku CVE, ID ATT&CK, atawa ngaran", "Search the data" "Paluruh data", "Security public data" "Data kaamanan publik", "Security services" "Layanan kaamanan", "Snapshot CID" "CID Snapshot", "Source and archive" "Sumber jeung arsip", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "Klaim anu bersumber, log anu diobservasi, jeung skenario analisis dijaga sina misah. Ngan sakadar aya dina daptar KEV moal nangtukeun yén hiji aset husus vulnerabel atawa nyebutkeun ngaran panyerang.", "Sourced relations" "Relasi anu bersumber", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "Pangujian kaamanan aplikasi statik: nganalisis kode sumber pikeun pola vulnerabel jeung sanitasi anu leungit, ngalaporkeun temuan kode ka buku besar VM.", "Technique" "Téhnik", "Techniques" "Téhnik", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "CID IPLD nya éta sumber kabeneran; wangun JSON-LD jeung Datomic dihasilkeun tina data anu sarua. Blok-blokna disayogikeun ngaliwatan HTTPS. Distribusi ka jaringan IPFS jeung pendaptaran dina ref tunggal énsiklopédi mangrupa léngkah anu misah.", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "Rangkaian layanan kaamanan first-party dina kotoba.cloud. Temuan CTEM, DAST, jeung SAST ngamalir ka buku besar VM dina hiji skéma babarengan.", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "Rékam sumber nunjuk kana URL asli, waktu pangambilan, jeung téks anu diarsipkeun.", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "Tilu layanan hulu ngahasilkeun temuan skéma babarengan; VM ngahapus duplikat, méré skor, sarta nyukcruk perbaikan.", "This hub" "Hub ieu", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "Kaca ieu jeung GET /v1/security/services dirender tina hiji définisi kanonikal anu sarua. Penegakan (enforcement) tetep dicekel ku authority pribadi; permukaan ieu ngan ngajelaskeun.", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "Skenario ieu mangrupa témplat analisis, sanés hasil observasi.", "Threat model" "Modél ancaman", "Threat models" "Modél ancaman", "VM integration: " "Integrasi VM: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM nya éta layanan buku besar: nampa temuan tilu layanan hulu dina skéma babarengan sarta ngahapus duplikat, méré skor, sarta nyukcruk perbaikan.", "Vulnerabilities" "Vulnerabilitas", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "Vulnerabilitas, téhnik, grup, jeung log — masing-masing bisa dilacak ka sumberna.", "Vulnerability" "Vulnerabilitas", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "Manajemén vulnerabilitas (wvme): nyokot temuan skéma babarengan anu dihasilkeun ku tilu layanan hulu, ngahapus duplikat sarta méré skor dumasar reachability jeung exploitability, sarta nyukcruk siklus hirup perbaikan dina buku besar anu dikonci ku CPE/CVE. Nampa asupan feed CVE/CPE.", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "konteks aset (rute publik, dependensi, pamilik)", "code findings with file and line" "temuan kode kalayan file jeung baris", "component shipped" "komponén dikirimkeun", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "inventarisasi aset jeung attack-surface éksternal sacara kontinyu", "dynamic probing of running applications" "pamariksaan dinamis kana aplikasi anu keur jalan", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "kajadian exposure anu dikirimkeun ka buku besar VM", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "déduplikasi temuan (konci aset × vulnerabilitas)", "gated" "digerendel", "inputs: " "asupan: ", "outputs: " "kaluaran: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "pamariksaan kalayan skenario nu geus dioténtikasi", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "skor reachability × exploitability", "reachable attack-path identification" "idéntifikasi jalur serangan anu bisa dicapai", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "siklus hirup perbaikan (kadeteksi → keur digarap → diverifikasi → ditutup)", "role: " "peran: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "deteksi kerapuhan runtime jadi temuan", "static source-code analysis" "analisis statis kode sumber", "taint / data-flow inspection" "pamariksaan taint / aliran data", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "buku ledger kerapuhan dikodekeun ku CPE/CVE", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} laporan baheula anu tacan dikonfirmasi. Lain jumlah korban anu geus dikonfirmasi.", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} item · {claims} klaim bersumber · dicokot {date} "}, :ur {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "ایک ابتدائی سنیپ شاٹ: KEV کے 50 حالیہ ترین اندراجات، تین ATT&CK گروپس اور ان کی تکنیکیں، اور OTRF کے عوامی لیب لاگز۔ SCAP وضاحتوں کا ایک کیٹلاگ ہے، نہ کہ کوئی تشخیصی انجن یا چیک کی تعریفات کا مکمل سیٹ۔ خودکار اپڈیٹس ترتیب نہیں دیے گئے ہیں۔", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "ایک شائع شدہ لیب آڈٹ لاگ۔ یہ حقیقی واقعہ نہیں ہے۔", "All" "تمام", "CID of this record" "اس ریکارڈ کا CID", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM حملے کے راستے اور اثاثہ سیاق و سباق VM لیجر کو فراہم کرتا ہے؛ یہ رسائی کے اسکور کی بنیاد ہیں۔", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "CVE/CPE فیڈ ان ٹیک", "Capability" "صلاحیت", "Catalog" "کیٹلاگ", "Chat" "چیٹ", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "مسلسل خطرہ نمائش کا انتظام: بیرونی حملہ سطح اور اینٹری پوائنٹس کو مسلسل شمار کرتا ہے، اور حملے کے راستے اور اثاثہ سیاق و سباق VM لیجر کو فراہم کرتا ہے۔", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "ڈیٹا لوڈ نہیں ہو سکا۔ بعد میں دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST دوبارہ پیدا کیے جا سکنے والے رن ٹائم نتائج (request/response شہادت) VM لیجر کو بھیجتا ہے۔", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "VM لیجر میں ڈیٹا فلو", "Datomic schema" "Datomic اسکیما", "Description" "تفصیل", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "متحرک ایپلیکیشن سیکیورٹی ٹیسٹنگ: چلنے والی ایپلیکیشنز کا معائنہ کرتا ہے اور رن ٹائم نتائج VM لیجر کو رپورٹ کرتا ہے۔", "Encyclopedia" "انسائیکلوپیڈیا", "Full record" "مکمل ریکارڈ", "Group" "گروپ", "Groups" "گروپس", "Guide for LLMs" "LLMs کے لیے رہنما", "History (unconfirmed)" "ہسٹری (غیر تصدیق شدہ)", "History data {n} " "ہسٹری ڈیٹا {n} ", "Home" "ہوم", "IPLD manifest" "IPLD مینی فیسٹ", "Item details" "آئٹم کی تفصیلات", "Kind of data" "ڈیٹا کی قسم", "Loading the data…" "ڈیٹا لوڈ ہو رہا ہے…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "MITRE ATT&CK کی استعمال کی شرائط", "No matching items." "کوئی مماثل آئٹم نہیں۔", "OTRF terms of use" "OTRF کی استعمال کی شرائط", "Ontology" "آنٹولوجی", "Public data" "عوامی ڈیٹا", "Public lab log" "عوامی لیب لاگ", "Public logs" "عوامی لاگز", "Read the audit log" "آڈٹ لاگ پڑھیں", "Research with this evidence" "اس شہادت کے ساتھ تحقیق کریں", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST فائل اور لائن کے ساتھ کوڈ کے نتائج VM لیجر کو بھیجتا ہے، جس سے فکس کا ہدف تیزی سے مل جاتا ہے۔", "Scenario and assumptions" "منظر نامہ اور مفروضات", "Scope and how the data is collected" "دائرہ کار اور ڈیٹا حاصل کرنے کا طریقہ", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "CVE، ATT&CK ID یا نام سے تلاش کریں", "Search the data" "ڈیٹا تلاش کریں", "Security public data" "سیکیورٹی عوامی ڈیٹا", "Security services" "سیکیورٹی سروسز", "Snapshot CID" "سنیپ شاٹ CID", "Source and archive" "ماخذ اور آرکائیو", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "ماخذ شدہ دعوے، مشاہدہ شدہ لاگز اور تجزیاتی منظرنامے علیحدہ رکھے جاتے ہیں۔ صرف KEV فہرست سے یہ فیصلہ نہیں ہوتا کہ کوئی مخصوص ایسٹ ولنریبل ہے یا کسی حملہ آور کا نام دیا جاتا ہے۔", "Sourced relations" "ماخذ شدہ تعلقات", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "اسٹیٹک ایپلیکیشن سیکیورٹی ٹیسٹنگ: سورس کوڈ کا تجزیہ کر کے ولنریبل پیٹرنز اور ناکافی سینیٹائزیشن کی نشاندہی کرتا ہے، اور کوڈ فائنڈنگز VM لیجر کو رپورٹ کرتا ہے۔", "Technique" "تکنیک", "Techniques" "تکنیکیں", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "IPLD CIDs حقیقت کا ماخذ ہیں؛ JSON-LD اور Datomic فارمز اسی ڈیٹا سے تیار کیے جاتے ہیں۔ بلاکس HTTPS پر فراہم کیے جاتے ہیں۔ IPFS نیٹ ورک پر تقسیم اور انسائیکلوپیڈیا کے واحد ref کے تحت رجسٹریشن الگ مراحل ہیں۔", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "kotoba.cloud پر فرسٹ پارٹی سیکیورٹی سروسز کا مجموعہ۔ CTEM، DAST اور SAST فائنڈنگز ایک مشترکہ اسکیمہ میں VM لیجر میں شامل ہوتے ہیں۔", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "ماخذ ریکارڈ اصل URL، حاصل کرنے کے وقت اور آرکائیو شدہ متن تک لے جاتا ہے۔", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "تین اپ اسٹریم سروسز مشترکہ اسکیمہ کے فائنڈنگز جاری کرتی ہیں؛ VM انہیں ڈیڈیوپلیکیٹ، اسکور اور ریمیڈیشن ٹریک کرتا ہے۔", "This hub" "یہ ہب", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "یہ صفحہ اور GET /v1/security/services ایک ہی معیاری تعریف سے رینڈر ہوتے ہیں۔ نفاذ نجی authority کے پاس رہتا ہے؛ یہ سطح صرف بیان کرتی ہے۔", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "یہ منظرنامہ ایک تجزیاتی ٹیمپلیٹ ہے، مشاہدہ نہیں۔", "Threat model" "تھریٹ ماڈل", "Threat models" "تھریٹ ماڈلز", "VM integration: " "VM انضمام: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM ایک لیجر سروس ہے: یہ تین اپ اسٹریم سروسز کے فائنڈنگز مشترکہ اسکیمہ میں وصول کرتا ہے اور انہیں ڈیڈیوپلیکیٹ، اسکور اور ریمیڈیشن ٹریک کرتا ہے۔", "Vulnerabilities" "ولنریبیلیٹیز", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "ولنریبیلیٹیز، تکنیکیں، گروپس اور لاگز — ہر ایک اپنے ماخذ تک قابلِ رد یابی۔", "Vulnerability" "ولنریبیلیٹی", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "ولنریبیلیٹی مینجمنٹ (wvme): تین اپ اسٹریم سروسز کے جاری کردہ مشترکہ اسکیمہ فائنڈنگز کو استعمال کرتا ہے، انہیں ری چیبلیٹی اور ایکسپلائٹیبلیٹی کے لحاظ سے ڈیڈیوپلیکیٹ اور اسکور کرتا ہے، اور CPE/CVE کی بنیاد پر ایک لیجر میں ریمیڈیشن لائف سائیکل ٹریک کرتا ہے۔ CVE/CPE فیڈ ان پٹ قبول کرتا ہے۔", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "ایسٹ کا سیاق و سباق (عوامی روٹس، انحصار، مالک)", "code findings with file and line" "فائل اور لائن کے ساتھ کوڈ فائنڈنگز", "component shipped" "کمپوننٹ شپ کر دیا گیا", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "بیرونی اٹیک سرفیس اور ایسٹ انوینٹری کی مسلسل شناخت", "dynamic probing of running applications" "چلتی ہوئی ایپلیکیشنز کی ڈائنامک جانچ", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "VM لیجر کو فیڈ کیے گئے ایکسپوزر ایونٹس", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "فائنڈنگ ڈیڈیوپلیکیشن (ایسٹ × ولنریبیلیٹی کلید)", "gated" "محدود رسائی", "inputs: " "ان پٹس: ", "outputs: " "آؤٹ پٹس: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "تصدیق شدہ منظرناموں کے ساتھ جانچ", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "ری چیبلیٹی × ایکسپلائٹیبلیٹی اسکورنگ", "reachable attack-path identification" "پہنچ میں آنے والے اٹیک پاتھ کی شناخت", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "ریمیڈیشن لائف سائیکل (شناخت → جاری → تصدیق شدہ → بند)", "role: " "کردار: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "رن ٹائم خطرات کی نشاندہی بطور نتائج", "static source-code analysis" "سٹیٹک سورس کوڈ تجزیہ", "taint / data-flow inspection" "ٹینٹ / ڈیٹا فلو معائنہ", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "CPE/CVE کی بنیاد پر خطرات کا لیجر", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "{count} گزشتہ غیر تصدیق شدہ رپورٹس۔ یہ تصدیق شدہ متاثرین کی تعداد نہیں ہے۔", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} اشیاء · {claims} مصدقہ دعوے · حاصل شدہ {date} "}, :zh-Hans {"A first snapshot: the 50 most recent KEV entries, three ATT&CK groups with their techniques, and OTRF's public lab logs. SCAP is a catalog of specifications, not an evaluation engine or the full set of check definitions. Automatic updates are not configured." "这是首个快照，收录了最新的 50 条 KEV 记录、ATT&CK 的三个组织及其相关技术，以及 OTRF 的公开实验室日志。SCAP 是规范目录，并非评估引擎或完整的检查定义集合。尚未配置自动更新。", "A published lab audit log. Not a real incident." "这是已发布的实验室审计日志，并非真实事件。", "All" "全部", "CID of this record" "此记录的 CID", "CTEM hands attack paths and asset context to the VM ledger; they are the basis of the reachability score." "CTEM 会将攻击路径和资产上下文传递给 VM 台账，作为可达性评分的依据。", "CVE/CPE feed intake" "CVE/CPE 数据源接入", "Capability" "功能", "Catalog" "目录", "Chat" "聊天", "Continuous Threat Exposure Management: continuously enumerates the external attack surface and entry points, and hands attack paths plus asset context to the VM ledger." "持续威胁暴露管理：持续枚举外部攻击面与入口点，并将攻击路径及资产上下文传递给 VM 台账。", "Could not load the data. Try again later." "无法加载数据，请稍后重试。", "DAST emits reproducible runtime findings (request/response evidence) to the VM ledger." "DAST 会将可复现的运行时发现（请求/响应证据）输出到 VM 台账。", "Dataflow into the VM ledger" "流入 VM 台账的数据流", "Datomic schema" "Datomic 模式", "Description" "说明", "Dynamic application security testing: probes running applications and reports runtime findings to the VM ledger." "动态应用安全测试：对运行中的应用进行探测，并将运行时发现报告给 VM 台账。", "Encyclopedia" "百科", "Full record" "完整记录", "Group" "组织", "Groups" "组织", "Guide for LLMs" "LLM 使用指南", "History (unconfirmed)" "历史记录（未确认）", "History data {n} " "历史数据 {n} ", "Home" "首页", "IPLD manifest" "IPLD 清单", "Item details" "项目详情", "Kind of data" "数据类型", "Loading the data…" "正在加载数据…", "MITRE ATT&CK terms of use" "MITRE ATT&CK 使用条款", "No matching items." "没有匹配的项目。", "OTRF terms of use" "OTRF 使用条款", "Ontology" "本体", "Public data" "公开数据", "Public lab log" "公开实验室日志", "Public logs" "公开日志", "Read the audit log" "查看审计日志", "Research with this evidence" "以此证据展开研究", "SAST emits code findings with file and line to the VM ledger, so the fix target is found faster." "SAST 会将附带文件与行号的代码发现输出到 VM 台账，从而更快定位修复目标。", "Scenario and assumptions" "场景与假设", "Scope and how the data is collected" "数据范围与采集方式", "Search by CVE, ATT&CK id or name" "按 CVE、ATT&CK ID 或名称搜索", "Search the data" "搜索数据", "Security public data" "安全公开数据", "Security services" "安全服务", "Snapshot CID" "快照 CID", "Source and archive" "来源与存档", "Sourced claims, observed logs and analysis scenarios are kept apart. A KEV listing alone never decides that a particular asset is vulnerable or names an attacker." "有出处的声明、观测日志和分析场景相互区分。仅凭 KEV 列表条目，不能判定某一特定资产存在漏洞或指认攻击者。", "Sourced relations" "有出处的关系", "Static application security testing: analyzes source code for vulnerable patterns and missing sanitization, reporting code findings to the VM ledger." "静态应用安全测试：分析源代码中的脆弱模式和缺失的净化处理，将代码发现上报至 VM 台账。", "Technique" "攻击技术", "Techniques" "攻击技术", "The IPLD CIDs are the source of truth; the JSON-LD and Datomic forms are generated from the same data. The blocks are served over HTTPS. Distribution to the IPFS network and registration under the encyclopedia's single ref are separate steps." "IPLD 的 CID 为权威来源，JSON-LD 和 Datomic 格式均由同一数据生成。这些区块通过 HTTPS 提供。分发至 IPFS 网络以及在百科的单一 ref 下注册均为独立步骤。", "The first-party security services suite on kotoba.cloud. CTEM, DAST and SAST findings flow into the VM ledger in one shared schema." "kotoba.cloud 上的第一方安全服务套件。CTEM、DAST 和 SAST 的检测结果以统一的通用模式汇入 VM 台账。", "The source record leads to the original URL, the fetch time and the archived text." "来源记录可追溯到原始 URL、获取时间及存档原文。", "The three upstream services emit shared-schema findings; VM dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "上游三个服务发出通用模式的检测结果，VM 负责去重、评分并跟踪修复。", "This hub" "本中心", "This page and GET /v1/security/services render from the one canonical def. Enforcement stays on the private authority; this surface only describes." "本页面与 GET /v1/security/services 均由同一份权威定义渲染而成。执行（enforcement）由私有 authority 负责，此界面仅作描述。", "This scenario is an analysis template, not an observation." "此场景为分析模板，并非观测事实。", "Threat model" "威胁模型", "Threat models" "威胁模型", "VM integration: " "VM 集成: ", "VM is the ledger service: it receives the three upstream services' findings in the shared schema and dedups, scores and tracks remediation." "VM 是台账服务：以通用模式接收上游三个服务的检测结果，进行去重、评分并跟踪修复。", "Vulnerabilities" "漏洞", "Vulnerabilities, techniques, groups and logs — each traceable to its source." "漏洞、攻击技术、组织和日志——均可追溯到来源。", "Vulnerability" "漏洞", "Vulnerability management (wvme): consumes the shared-schema findings emitted by the three upstream services, dedups and scores them by reachability and exploitability, and tracks the remediation lifecycle in a ledger keyed by CPE/CVE. Accepts CVE/CPE feed input." "漏洞管理 (wvme)：接收上游三个服务发出的通用模式检测结果，按可达性和可利用性进行去重和评分，并以 CPE/CVE 为键在台账中跟踪修复生命周期。接受 CVE/CPE 数据源输入。", "asset context (public routes, dependencies, owner)" "资产上下文（公开路径、依赖、所有者）", "code findings with file and line" "代码发现（文件和行号）", "component shipped" "组件已上线", "continuous external attack-surface and asset inventory" "持续的外部攻击面与资产清单枚举", "dynamic probing of running applications" "对运行中应用的动态探测", "exposure events fed to the VM ledger" "曝露事件反馈至 VM 台账", "finding deduplication (asset × vulnerability key)" "检测结果去重（资产 × 漏洞键）", "gated" "受限中", "inputs: " "输入: ", "outputs: " "输出: ", "probing with authenticated scenarios" "使用认证场景进行探测", "reachability × exploitability scoring" "可达性 × 可利用性评分", "reachable attack-path identification" "可达攻击路径识别", "remediation lifecycle (detected → in progress → verified → closed)" "修复生命周期（检测 → 处理中 → 已验证 → 已关闭）", "role: " "角色: ", "runtime vulnerability detection as findings" "运行时漏洞检测生成发现", "static source-code analysis" "静态源代码分析", "taint / data-flow inspection" "污点/数据流检测", "vulnerability ledger keyed by CPE/CVE" "以 CPE/CVE 为键的漏洞台账", "{count} past unconfirmed reports. Not a count of confirmed victims." "过去 {count} 份未确认报告。并非已确认受害数量。", "{items} items · {claims} sourced claims · fetched {date} " "{items} 项 · {claims} 条有来源的声明 · 获取于 {date} "}})
